<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Biblica® Open Akuapem Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Marko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marko Asɛmpa No</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="mt1">Marko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Asɛmpa No</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Osuboni Yohane Asɛnka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Asɛmpa a ɛfa Yesu Kristo, Onyankopɔn Ba no ho no mfiase ni. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Wɔakyerɛw wɔ Odiyifo Yesaia nhoma no mu se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Mɛsoma me bɔfo adi wʼanim kan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">Ɔno na obesiesie ɔkwan ama wo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>“Obi nne reteɛ mu wɔ sare so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Munsiesie ɔkwan mma Awurade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">mommɔ akwan a ɛteɛ mma no.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Enti Yohane ba bɛbɔɔ asu wɔ sare so, ɔkaa adwensakra asubɔ a ɛma bɔnefakyɛ ho asɛm. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Nnipa fifi Yerusalem ne Yudea nkurow nyinaa so kohuu Yohane tiee no. Na wɔkaa wɔn bɔne kyerɛɛ no no, ɔbɔɔ wɔn asu wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan mu. <verse eid="MRK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Na Yohane hyɛ atade a wɔde yoma nwi na apam a aboa nhoma abɔso nso bɔ mu. Na nʼaduan yɛ mmoadabi ne ɛwo. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Ɔrekyerɛkyerɛ no, ɔkae se, “Ɛrenkyɛ koraa, obi bɛba a ɔwɔ tumi sen me, a ne mpaboa hama mpo, mensɛ sɛ mekotow na masan. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Me de, mede nsu na ɛbɔ mo asu, na ɔno de, ɔde Honhom Kronkron na ɛbɛbɔ mo asu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asubɔ Ne Ne Sɔhwɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Saa bere no mu na Yesu fi Nasaret a ɛwɔ Galileaman mu ba maa Yohane bɔɔ no asu wɔ asubɔnten Yordan mu. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Yesu fii asu no mu sii konkɔn so ara pɛ, ohuu sɛ ɔsoro abue, na Honhom Kronkron resian sɛ aborɔnoma aba ne so. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Na nne bi fi ɔsoro kae se, “Wone me Dɔba a wosɔ mʼani.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Ɛhɔ ara, Honhom Kronkron de Yesu kɔɔ sare so. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Ɔtenaa hɔ adaduanan a na wuram mmoa na ɛka ne ho. Ɛhɔ na ɔbonsam sɔɔ no hwɛe. Akyiri no, abɔfo ba bɛsom no.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Ɔhene Herode kyeree Yohane akyi no, Yesu kɔɔ Galilea kɔkaa asɛmpa no wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Ɔkae se, <char style="wj">“Bere no awie du! Onyankopɔn ahenni no abɛn. Monsakra mo adwene na munnye asɛmpa no nni!”</char><verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Bɔ Asɛmpa No Ho Amanneɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Da bi a Yesu nam Galilea mpoano no, ohuu Simon ne ne nua Andrea sɛ wɔregu asau. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Yesu frɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mummedi mʼakyi! Na mɛma mo ayɛ nnipayifo.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Ɛhɔ ara, wogyaw wɔn asau no guu hɔ kodii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Ɔkɔɔ nʼanim kakra no, ohuu Sebedeo mma baanu a wɔfrɛ ɔbaako Yohane, na ɔbaako nso de Yakobo, sɛ wɔte ɔkorow mu reyɛ wɔn asau ho adwuma. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Ɔfrɛɛ wɔn nso se wommedi nʼakyi. Ntɛm ara na wogyaw wɔn agya Sebedeo ne nʼapaafo hɔ wɔ ɔkorow no mu bedii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tu Honhommɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Yesu ne nʼakyidifo yi beduu Kapernaum. Na Homeda duu no, ɔkɔɔ asɔredan mu kɔkaa asɛmpa no. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Nnipa no tee asɛm no maa wɔn ho dwiriw wɔn, efisɛ ɔkasaa te sɛ obi a ɔwɔ tumi, na mmom wankasa sɛ Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo no. <verse eid="MRK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Amono mu hɔ ara na ɔbarima bi a ɔwɔ wɔn hyiadan no mu hɔ a ɔwɔ honhommɔne teɛɛ mu se, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>“Dɛn na wo Nasareni Yesu ne yɛn wɔ yɛ? Woaba sɛ worebɛsɛe yɛn ana? Minim wo sɛ wone Onyankopɔn Ba Kronkron no!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yesu teɛteɛɛ honhommɔne no se, <char style="wj">“Mua wʼano! Fi ne mu kɔ!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Honhommɔne no wosow saa ɔbarima no na ɔteɛteɛɛ mu dennen maa ne tu kɔe.<verse eid="MRK 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Nnipa no nyinaa ho dwiriw wɔn ma wobisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho se. “Nkyerɛkyerɛ foforo bɛn ni? Ahonhommɔne mpo tie ne nne!” <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Saa anwonwade a ɔyɛe yi ho nsɛm trɛw faa Galileaman mu nyinaa.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Nyarewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Wofii hyiadan no mu no, wɔne Yakobo ne Yohane kɔɔ Simon ne Andrea fi. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Na Simon asebea da mpa so a atiridii akyere no, na wɔkaa ne ho asɛm kyerɛɛ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Yesu kɔɔ faako a ɔda hɔ kosoo ne nsa ma ɔsɔre tenaa ase. Ɛhɔ ara na atiridii no tu fii ne so ma ofii ase twɛn wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Eduu anwummere no, nnipa no de ayarefo ne wɔn a wɔwɔ ahonhommɔne brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔnsa wɔn yare. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Kurow mu no nyinaa bɛboaa wɔn ho ano wɔ ofi no abobow ano, <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>na Yesu saa ayarefo bebree yare. Otuu ahonhommɔne bebree nso. Nanso, wamma ahonhommɔne no ankasa, efisɛ, na wonim no.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Twee Ne Ho Kɔbɔɔ Mpae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Ahemadakye a na anim ntetewee no, Yesu sɔre fii fie hɔ kɔɔ baabi a ɛhɔ yɛ dinn, kɔbɔɔ mpae wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simon ne wɔn a wɔka ne ho fii adi kɔhwehwɛɛ no, <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>na wohuu no no, wɔteɛɛ mu kae se, “Nnipa bebree rehwehwɛ wo!”<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛkɔ nkurow a aka no so, na mekɔka mʼasɛm kyerɛ wɔn, efisɛ, ɛno nti na mebae.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Enti, ɔkɔɔ Galileaman mu baabiara kɔkaa asɛmpa no wɔ asɔredan mu, tuu ahonhommɔne bebree nso.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Ɔkwatani Bi Yare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Ɔkwatani bi bɛkotow no srɛɛ no sɛ, “Sɛ ɛyɛ wo pɛ a, wubetumi ama me ho afi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Yesu huu ɔkwatani no mmɔbɔ, enti ɔde ne nsa kaa no kae se, <char style="wj">“Mepɛ! Wo ho mfi!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Amono mu hɔ ara, ne ho fi maa ne ho tɔɔ no!<verse eid="MRK 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Yesu bɔɔ nʼano denneennen se, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/><char style="wj">“Nka saa asɛm yi nkyerɛ obiara, na mmom fa wo ho kɔkyerɛ ɔsɔfo. Sɛ worekɔ a fa wʼafɔrebɔde a Mose ahyɛ sɛ akwatafo a wɔasa wɔn yare mfa nka wɔn ho nkɔ no ka wo ho kɔ sɛnea ɛbɛma obiara ahu sɛ wo ho atɔ wo.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Nanso ɔrekɔ no nyinaa, na ɔde nteɛteɛmu rebɔ nʼayaresa no ho dawuru. Esiane eyi nti sɛ Yesu kɔ baabiara a, nnipadɔm betwa ne ho hyia. Ɛno nti na baabiara a ɔbɛkɔ no onnyi ne ho adi. Enti ɔtenaa sare so hɔ maa nnipa bebree baa ne nkyɛn.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu De Obubuafo Bi Bɔne Kyɛ No Sa No Yare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Nna bi akyi no, Yesu kɔɔ Kapernaum bio. Oduu hɔ no nnipa pii tee sɛ waba hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Ankyɛ na nnipa bebree bɛhyɛɛ ofi a na ɔwɔ mu no mu ma tɔ. Ɔkaa asɛmpa no kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Mmarima baanan bi de obubuafo bi a wɔso no baa hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Esiane sɛ na wontumi mfa nnipadɔm no mu nkɔ Yesu nkyɛn no nti, wɔforoo ɔdan a Yesu wɔ mu no, kotuu tokuru wɔ atifi. Wɔde obubuafo a ɔda ne kɛtɛ so no faa mu, gyaagyaa no brɛoo de no kɔtoo Yesu anim. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Yesu huu wɔn gyidi a wɔwɔ wɔ ne mu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ ɔyarefo no se, <char style="wj">“Ɔba, wɔde wo bɔne akyɛ wo!”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo a wɔwɔ hɔ no tee nea Yesu kae no, wɔdwenee wɔ wɔn tirim <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>se, “Asɛm bɛn na ɔreka yi! Abususɛm na ɔreka yi! Osusuw sɛ ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn? Onyankopɔn nko na otumi de bɔne kyɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Mpofirim na Yesu huu wɔn adwene ma obisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Adɛn na moma asɛm a mekae yi haw mo?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/><char style="wj">Nea ɛwɔ he na ɛyɛ mmerɛw: sɛ wɔbɛka akyerɛ obubuafo yi se, ‘Wɔde wo bɔne akyɛ wo,’ anaa wɔbɛka se, ‘Sɔre, fa wo kɛtɛ na nantew?’</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/><char style="wj">Nanso sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ na mubehu sɛ Onipa Ba no wɔ tumi wɔ asase so sɛ ɔde bɔne kyɛ,”</char> Enti ɔka kyerɛɛ obubuafo no se, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/><char style="wj">“Mise wo sɛ, sɔre gyina hɔ, fa wo kɛtɛ, na kɔ fie.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Obubuafo yi sɔre bobɔw ne kɛtɛ, na ɔde anigye ne ahosɛpɛw faa nnipadɔm no mu kɔe. Nnipa no ho dwiriw wɔn ma wɔkamfoo Onyankopɔn se, “Yenhuu eyi bi da!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Frɛ Lewi Na Ɔne Nnebɔneyɛfo Didi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Yesu san kɔɔ mpoano hɔ bio, na ɔkaa asɛmpa no kyerɛɛ nnipakuw a wɔahyia wɔ hɔ no. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Bere a ɔnam mpoano hɔ no, ohuu Alfeo ba Lewi sɛ ɔte atowgyei. Ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Di mʼakyi.”</char> Na Lewi sɔre dii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Saa anadwofa no, Lewi too pon, too nsa frɛɛ ne mfɛfo towgyefo ne nnebɔneyɛfo bi sɛ wɔmmra na ɔne wɔn ne Yesu ne nʼasuafo no nto nsa nnidi. Nnipa a wodii Yesu akyi no bi te sɛ Lewi ara pɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Farisifo no huu sɛ ɔne nnebɔneyɛfo ne towgyefo ato nsa redidi no, wobisaa nʼasuafo no se, “Adɛn nti na ɔne towgyefo ne nnebɔneyɛfo to nsa didi?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Yesu tee nea wɔkae no, obuaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Wɔn a wɔwɔ ahoɔden no, ɔyaresafo ho nhia wɔn, na wɔn a wɔyare no na ɔyaresafo ho hia wɔn. Mamma sɛ merebɛka akyerɛ atreneefo sɛ wɔnsakra wɔn adwene na mmom, nnebɔneyɛfo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wobisa Yesu Asɛm Fa Mmuadadi Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Da bi a Osuboni Yohane akyidifo ne Farisifo no redi mmuada no, nnipa bi kɔɔ Yesu nkyɛn kobisaa no se, “Adɛn nti na Yohane ne Farisifo no akyidifo di mmuada na wʼakyidifo de, wonni mmuada?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Moahu ayeforokunu nnamfo a wɔbɛba ayeforo ase a wɔbɛka se, wɔredi mmuada nti wɔrennidi ana? Mmere dodow a wɔne ayeforokunu no nam no de, wɔrenni mmuada da.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/><char style="wj">Na da bi bɛba a, wɔbɛfa ayeforokunu no afi wɔn nkyɛn. Saa bere no na wobedi mmuada.</char><verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛte sɛ wode ntama foforo atare ntama dedaw mu. Dɛn na ɛba? Ntaremu no bɛtew ntama dedaw no mu, na ayi afi mu, na ama tokuru a ɛda hɔ no aso asen kan de no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/><char style="wj">Munim sɛ wɔmfa nsa foforo ngu aboa nhoma nkotoku dedaw mu. Anyɛ saa a, ɛbɛpae. Nsa no behwie agu, na nkotoku a nsa no wɔ mu no nso bɛpaapae. Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde nsa foforo gu nkotoku foforo mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yɛ Homeda Wura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Homeda bi a Yesu ne nʼasuafo nam aburowfuw bi mu no, asuafo no pempan aburow no bi wee. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Farisifo no bi ka kyerɛɛ Yesu se, “Hwɛ, adɛn na wɔreyɛ nea etia mmara Homeda?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monnkenkan nea Ɔhene Dawid yɛe, bere a ɔkɔm dee ɔne wɔn a na wɔka ne ho no,</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/><char style="wj">ne sɛnea ɔkɔɔ Onyankopɔn fi wɔ Ɔsɔfopanyin Abiatar bere so, na ɔne wɔn a wɔka ne ho kodii brodo a wɔde abɔ afɔre ama Onyankopɔn no, a obiara nni ho kwan sɛ odi, gye asɔfo nko ara no pɛ? Na ɛno nso tia mmara.</char><verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Onipa nti na wɔyɛɛ Homeda, na ɛnyɛ Homeda nti na wɔbɔɔ onipa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/><char style="wj">Enti Onipa Ba no yɛ Homeda so wura mpo!”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Yare Homeda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Yesu baa Kapernaum no, ɔkɔɔ hyiadan mu bio. Oduu hɔ no, ohuu ɔbarima bi a ne nsa baako awu. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Na saa da no yɛ Homeda enti na Yesu atamfo no retetɛw no ahwɛ sɛ ɔbɛsa ɔbarima no yare ana. Na wɔabɔ wɔn tirim sɛ, sɛ ɔsa no yare a wɔbɛkyere no! <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ ɔbarima no se ommegyina nnipa no anim.<verse eid="MRK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Ɔdan ne ho kyerɛɛ nʼatamfo no bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Eye sɛ obi yɛ papa Homeda? Anaasɛ ɛyɛ da a wɔde yɛ bɔne? Ɛyɛ da a wɔde gye nkwa anaa wɔma obi nkwa hwere no”</char> Nanso wɔammua no.<verse eid="MRK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Ɔde abufuw hwɛɛ wɔn hyiae. Ɛhaw no sɛ wonni ahummɔbɔ mma nnipa enti ɔka kyerɛɛ ɔbarima no se, <char style="wj">“Teɛ wo nsa no mu.”</char> Ɔteɛɛ mu na amono mu hɔ ara, ne nsa no yɛɛ yiye. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Farisifo no kohyiaa Herodefo no ne wɔn susuw ɔkwan a wɔbɛfa so akum Yesu no ho.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dɔm Tu Di Yesu Akyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo no fii hɔ kɔɔ mpoano. Nnipadɔm fifi Galilea, Yudea, Yerusalem, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>Idumea, Asubɔnten Yordan agya, Tiro ne Sidon fam nyinaa, tu dii Yesu akyi. Efisɛ na nʼanwonwade a ɔyɛ no atrɛw mmaa nyinaa enti na ebinom pɛ sɛ wɔbɛhwɛ no. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, wɔmpɛ ɔkorow bi nsi nkyɛn baabi, na sɛ nnipadɔm no kyere ne so wɔ mpoano hɔ a, watena mu akɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Da no, na wasa nyarewa bebree a ne saa nti na ayarefo no ba ara na wɔreba a wɔpɛe sɛ wɔde wɔn nsa ka nʼatade. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Bere biara a wɔn a wɔwɔ ahonhommɔne no bi behu no no, wotwa hwe fam, wosow biribiri, ka se, “Woyɛ Onyankopɔn Ba.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Nanso ɔbɔɔ wɔn ano se, wɔnkyerɛ onipa ko a ɔyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Paw Asuafo Dumien No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Yeau kɔɔ bepɔw so na ɔfrɛɛ wɔn a wayi wɔn no baa ne nkyɛn. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Oyii wɔn mu dumien a daa wɔne no bɛnantew, na wɔakɔka asɛmpa no, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>na wɔatu ahonhommɔne nso.<verse eid="MRK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Dumien a oyii wɔn no din ni:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 3:16"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:16">Simon, a ɔtoo no din foforo Petro.<verse eid="MRK 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Sebedeo mma Yakobo ne Yohane, a ɔtoo wɔn din Boanerges, a ase ne “aprannaa mma”.<verse eid="MRK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Wɔn a wɔka ho nso ni: Andrea,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Filipo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Bartolomeo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Mateo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Alfeo ba Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Tadeo ne</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Simon ɔmanyɛfo,<verse eid="MRK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>na Yuda Iskariot a oyii no mae no.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Ɔsan baa ofi a ɔte mu no mu no, nnipakuw bi san baa ne so bio. Ankyɛ koraa na hɔ nyinaa yɛɛ ma a onnya kwan koraa nnidi. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Ne fifo tee asɛm a aba no, wɔkɔɔ hɔ sɛ wɔrekɔfa no akɔ wɔn fi efisɛ wɔkae se, “Ne ti mu ka no.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ka Nyaatwomfo Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo a wofi Yerusalem bae no kae se, “Beelsebul a ɔyɛ ahonhommɔne panyin no afa no, na ɔnam saa tumi no so na otu ahonhommɔne no.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Yesu frɛɛ wɔn kasa kyerɛɛ wɔn abebu mu se, <char style="wj">“Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na Satan betumi atu Satan?</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/><char style="wj">Ahenni biara a ɛne ne ho di asi no begu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/><char style="wj">Saa ara na ofi biara a ɛne ne ho di asi no nnyina ara ne no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ Satan twa ne ho ne ne ho di asi a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na watumi adi nkonim? Obedi nkogu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/><char style="wj">Obiara ntumi nkɔ ɔhoɔdenfo fi nkɔfa ne nneɛma kwa, agye sɛ, onii no di kan kyekyere ɔhoɔdenfo no, ansa na watumi afa ne nneɛma.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo se, bɔne a onipa ayɛ biara no, wotumi de kyɛ no, na mpo obi ka abususɛm tia me a, wotumi de kyɛ no;</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/><char style="wj">nanso nea ɔka abususɛm tia Honhom Kronkron no de, wɔremfa nkyɛ no da. Ɛyɛ bɔne a ɛrempepa da.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Ɔkaa saa asɛm yi efisɛ na wɔka se, “Ɔwɔ honhommɔne.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Na Ne Ne Nuanom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Ogu so rekyerɛkyerɛ no, ne na ne ne nuanom begyinaa nnipadɔm no mu baabi somaa obi se, ɔnkɔfrɛ no mmra, na wɔne no nkasa. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Saa bere no na nnipadɔm no atwa ne ho ahyia. Nnipa no ka kyerɛɛ Yesu se, “Wo na ne wo nuanom gyina afikyiri hɔ pɛ sɛ wɔne wo kasa.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Hena ne me na? Hefo ne me nuanom?”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Ɔhwɛɛ nnipadɔm no hyia kae se, <char style="wj">“Eyinom ne me na ne me nuanom!</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔbɛyɛ Onyankopɔn apɛde no, ɔno ne me nuabarima ne me nuabea ne me na.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ogufo Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Bere a ogu so rekyerɛkyerɛ no, nnipadɔm san betwaa ne ho hyiaa wɔ mpoano hɔ. Eyi nti ɔkɔtenaa ɔkorow mu toaa ne kyerɛkyerɛ no so. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Na sɛnea ɔyɛ daa no, ɔnam mmebu so kyerɛɛ wɔn nneɛma bebree se: <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/><char style="wj">“Muntie! Okuafo bi kɔɔ nʼafum koguu aba. Ogu so regu aba no,</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/><char style="wj">Ogu so regu aba no, aba no bi guu kwankyɛn maa nnomaa bɛsosɔw ne nyinaa dii.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/><char style="wj">Ebi nso koguu ɔbotan a dɔte a ɛwɔ so no nnɔɔso so.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/><char style="wj">Ankyɛ na efifii, nanso esiane sɛ dɔte a ɛwɔ ɔbotan no so no nnɔɔso no nti owia bɔɔ so, na ne nyinaa hyewee.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/><char style="wj">Aba no bi nso guu nsɔe mu maa nsɔe no kyekyeree no nti antumi ansow aba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/><char style="wj">Aba no bi nso guu asase pa mu maa bi nyin sow mmɔho aduasa, ebi aduosia, na afoforo nso mmɔho ɔha.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Na Yesu kae se, <char style="wj">“Nea ɔwɔ aso no ntie!”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Akyiri no a ɛkaa ɔne dumien no ne asuafo afoforo bi no, wobisaa no se, “Asɛm a wokae no ase ne dɛn?” <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Obuaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo de, wɔada Onyankopɔn Ahenni ho ahintasɛm adi akyerɛ mo. Nanso afoforo de, wɔka no abebu mu na ɛkyerɛ wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/><char style="wj">Esiane saa nti,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Wohu na wɔte, nanso wɔrente nea wɔte no ase,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">na wɔrennan mma Onyankopɔn nkyɛn,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">na wɔremfa wɔn bɔne nso nkyɛ wɔn.’</char><verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na sɛ moante saa bɛ yi ase a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na moate mmɛ ahorow a merebebu no ase?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/><char style="wj">Okuafo no asɛm no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/><char style="wj">Aba a eguu kwankyɛn no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔte Onyankopɔn asɛm, nanso sɛ wɔte asɛm no a ntɛm ara na ɔbonsam ba wɔn nkyɛn ma wɔn werɛ fi nea wɔate no nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/><char style="wj">Aba a eguu ɔbotan so no gyina hɔ ma nnipa a wɔde anigye tie asɛm no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/><char style="wj">Nanso wɔte sɛ aba a afifi foforo a ne ntin nkɔ fam. Mfiase no wɔkɔ so fɛfɛɛfɛ, nanso sɛ ɛba sɛ asɛm no nti ɔtaa anaa amanehunu bi to wɔn pɛ a na wɔapa abaw.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/><char style="wj">Aba a eguu nsɔe mu no nso gyina hɔ ma nnipa a wɔte asɛmpa no,</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/><char style="wj">nanso ɛnkyɛ koraa na wiase yi mu afɛfɛde ne ahonyade ne ɔbra yi mu dadwen, nnaadaa ne nneɛma bi ho akɔnnɔ abɛhyɛ wɔn koma mu. Eyi nti asɛm no ntumi nsow aba biara.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/><char style="wj">Nnipa no bi te sɛ aba a wogu wɔ asase pa mu, wɔte asɛm no, wogye, na wɔsow aba— bi mmɔho aduasa, bi nso sow aduosia, na afoforo nso sow ɔha.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanea So Mfaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Afei Yesu bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Moahu obi a ɔsɔ kanea na ɔde hyɛ mpa ase, anaasɛ ɔde ahina butuw so? Mmom mommfa nsi ne dua so ana?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/><char style="wj">Wɔbɛda nea ahintaw biara no adi, na nea wɔakata so biara no wɔde bepue gua.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/><char style="wj">Nea ɔwɔ aso a obetie no, ma ontie!</char><verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Momfa asɛm a mote no nyɛ adwuma. Wɔde mo susukuruwa besusuw ama mo, na ama aboro so mpo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/><char style="wj">Nea ɔwɔ no, wɔbɛma no bi aka ho; nea onni no, kakraa bi a ɔwɔ no mpo, wobegye afi ne nsam.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aba A Ɛrenyin Ho Abebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Ɔkaa bio se, <char style="wj">“Sɛnea Onyankopɔn Ahenni no te ni: Okuafo bi gu aba wɔ asase bi so.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/><char style="wj">Awia ne anadwo, sɛ ɔda o, sɛ onyan o, aba no fifi a onnim sɛnea ɛyɛɛ a enyinii.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/><char style="wj">Asase no ankasa bɔ nʼaduan, dua no na edi kan, afei etu mɛpɛsɛe na abɔ ama aba no anyin.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/><char style="wj">Sɛ aba no nyin wie a, okuafo no fa ne dade kotwa, efisɛ otwa bere adu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyaa Aba Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Ɔsan kae se, <char style="wj">“Dɛn ho na yɛde Ɔsoro Ahenni no bɛto, anaa mmebusɛm bɛn na yɛde bɛkyerɛkyerɛ mu?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/><char style="wj">Ɛte sɛ onyaa aba, a ɛyɛ ketewaa wɔ aba a wodua nyinaa mu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wodua a enyin yɛ kɛse sen nnua a aka no nyinaa, eyiyi mman akɛse ma wim nnomaa besisi ne nwini mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Mmebu a ɛtete sɛ eyinom na Yesu de kaa asɛm no kyerɛɛ wɔn, sɛnea wobetumi ate ase. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Ɔnam mmebu so na ɔkasa kyerɛɛ wɔn a wobetiee no no nyinaa, na sɛ ɛka ɔne nʼasuafo no nko a, ɔkyerɛ wɔn ne nyinaa ase.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Brɛ Ahum Ase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Eduu anwummere no, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Momma yentwa nkɔ asuogya nohɔ.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Ɔkaa saa no, wogyaw nnipadɔm no hɔ na ɔne wɔn kɔe a akorow afoforo di wɔn akyi. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Prɛko pɛ, ahum kɛse bi tu maa asorɔkye bu bɛkataa ɔkorow no so ma ɛyɛɛ sɛ ɛremem. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Saa bere no, na Yesu wɔ ɔkorow no to de ne ti ato sumii so ada. Asuafo no de ahopopo ne nteɛteɛ mu konyan no kae se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo, yɛreyɛ amem yi ɛmfa wo ho?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Ɔsɔre teɛteɛɛ mframa no ka kyerɛɛ po no se, <char style="wj">“Yɛ komm!”</char> Mframa no gyaee, na po no yɛɛ komm!<verse eid="MRK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Adɛn na moyɛ ahufo sɛɛ? Moda so nni gyidi ara?”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Na wɔn ho dwiriw wɔn yiye, bisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho se, “Onipa bɛn ni a mframa ne po mpo tie no yi?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Ɔbarima Bi A Ɔwɔ Ahonhommɔne Yare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo no twaa ɔtare no koduu Gerasefo asase so. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Ɔresi afi ɔkorow no mu no, ɔbarima bi a ahonhommɔne wɔ ne mu de mmirika fi amusiei behyiaa no. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Na saa ɔbarima yi te abonna mu a obiara ntumi mfa nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn nkyekyere no bio. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Ɔyɛ obi a na ne ho yɛ den yiye nti, sɛ wɔde nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn gu ne nsa mpo a, otumi bubu mu a obiara ntumi nkɔ nʼanim. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Anadwo ne awia nyinaa na ɔnenam amusiei hɔ mmepɔw no mu a, ɔde abo a ano yɛ nam twitwa ne ho.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Ɔbarima yi huu Yesu wɔ akyirikyiri no, otuu mmirika, bebuu no nkotodwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>Ɔteɛteɛɛ mu se, “Yesu, Ɔsorosoro Nyankopɔn no Ba, dɛn na wowɔ ne me yɛ? Onyankopɔn din mu, nyɛ me ayayade biara!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Yesu teɛɛ honhommɔne a ɛwɔ ɔbarima no mu no se, <char style="wj">“Honhommɔne, fi ne mu kɔ!”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Yesu bisaa no se, <char style="wj">“Wɔfrɛ wo dɛn?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Obuaa Yesu se, “Me din de ‘Dɔm’ efisɛ yɛdɔɔso.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Afei ɔsrɛɛ Yesu anibere so sɛ ɔmmpam wɔn nnkɔ akyirikyiri.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Saa bere no na mprakokuw bi redidi wɔ bepɔw no nkyɛn baabi a ɛbɛn po no. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Enti ahonhommɔne no srɛɛ Yesu se, “Tu yɛn na yɛnkɔhyɛ mprako no mu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Yesu maa wɔn ho kwan ma wɔkɔhyɛɛ mprako no mu. Mprakokuw bɛyɛ mpenu no de ahoɔhare sian bepɔw no koguu po no mu ma ɛfaa wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Mprakohwɛfo no guan baa nkurow a ɛbɛn hɔ no mu bɛkaa nea wɔahu no kyerɛɛ wɔn. Wɔn a wɔtee no kɔhwɛɛ nea asi no. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Nnipakuw no duu faako a Yesu wɔ no wohuu ɔbarima a na honhommɔne ahyɛ no ma no sɛ ɔte hɔ dinn a nʼadwene mu atew no. Eyi maa wɔn ho dwiriw wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Wɔn a wohuu asɛm a asi no ka kyerɛɛ afoforo. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Afei nnipakuw no fii ase srɛɛ Yesu se, omfi wɔn man mu nkɔ!<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Yesu reforo ɔkorow akɔtena mu no, ɔbarima a na honhommɔne wɔ ne mu no srɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɔne no kɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Nanso Yesu kae se, <char style="wj">“Dabi, na kɔ na kɔka anwonwade a Onyankopɔn ayɛ ama wo yi ne nʼahummɔbɔ ho asɛm kyerɛ wʼabusuafo.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Enti ɔbarima no fi hɔ kɔɔ Dekapoli, “Nkurow Du” no a ɛwɔ saa ɔmantam no mu no mu kɔkaa anwonwade a Yesu ayɛ ama no no kyerɛɛ obiara. Wɔtee asɛm no wɔn ho dwiriw wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbea Bi Ayaresa Ne Abeawa Bi Nyan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Yesu de ɔkorow no twa baa po no fa baabi no, nnipakuw betwaa ne ho hyiaa wɔ mpoano hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Asafopanyin a na wɔfrɛ no Yairo baa hɔ na ohuu Yesu no obuu nkotodwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>srɛɛ no se ɔnsa ne babea yare mma no. Ofi ahoyeraw mu ka kyerɛɛ Yesu se, “Abofra no rewu, enti mesrɛ wo sɛ, fa wo nsa bɛka no na onya nkwa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Yesu ne no kɔe a nnipakuw no di wɔn akyi.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Na ɔbea bi a watu mogya mfe dumien ka nnipakuw no ho. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Ɔde ne yare no akyin ayaresafo bebree so, atua sika bebree ama wayɛ ohiani, nanso na ne ho ntɔ no ara. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Na wate anwonwade a Yesu ayɛ no nyinaa, na ɛno nti ɔde ne ho fraa nnipakuw no, de ne nsa besoo Yesu atade mu no. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Ɔdwenee ho kae se, “Sɛ mitumi nya ne ho kwan, de me nsa so nʼatade mu kɛkɛ a, me ho bɛtɔ me.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Ampa ara, so a osoo nʼatade no mu pɛ na mogya no twa maa ne ho tɔɔ no.<verse eid="MRK 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Amono mu hɔ ara, Yesu tee nka sɛ tumi bi afi ne mu. Ɔdan ne ho kyerɛɛ nnipakuw no bisae se, <char style="wj">“Hena na osoo mʼatade mu no?”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Nʼasuafo no buae se, “Saa nnipakuw a obiara de ne ho twitwiw ne yɔnko yi na worebisa se, <char style="wj">‘Hena na ɔde ne nsa aka mʼatade?’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Nanso ɔpɛɛ sɛ ohu onipa ko a osoo nʼatade mu no. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Bere a ɔbea no huu asɛm a asi no, ɔde ahopopo bebuu Yesu nkotodwe kaa nea ɔyɛe no kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Ɔbabea, wo gyidi ama wo ho atɔ wo; fa asomdwoe kɔ; wo yare no agyae.”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yairo Babea No Nyan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Ogu so rekasa akyerɛ ɔbea no, abɔfo fi Yairo fi bɛkae se, “Wo babea no awu; adɛn na woda so haw kyerɛkyerɛfo no?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Yesu antie nea na wɔreka no koraa, na ɔka kyerɛɛ Yairo se, <char style="wj">“Nsuro, gye di ara.”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Afei, Yesu amma obiara anni nʼakyi ankɔ Yairo fi hɔ, gye Petro, Yakobo ne Yohane. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Bere a Yesu duu hɔ no, ohuu sɛ hɔ nyinaa ayɛ manyamanya a nnipa retwa agyaadwo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Ɔkɔɔ ofi no mu ne wɔn a wɔwɔ hɔ no kɔkasae. Obisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Adɛn ne agyaadwotwa ne gyegyeegye yi? Abofra no nwui; nna na wada!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Wɔn a wɔwɔ hɔ no tee asɛm a Yesu kae no, wɔserew no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn a wɔwɔ fie hɔ no se, wɔn nyinaa mfi adi. Ɔne abofra no agya ne ne na ne nʼasuafo baasa no kɔɔ nea abofra no da hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Osoo abofra no nsa kae sɛ, <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Talita, Kuum!”</char></char> a ase ne sɛ <char style="wj">“Abaawa, mise wo sɛ sɔre!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Amono mu hɔ ara, abeawa no sɔree, na ofii ase nantewee (na wadi mfe dumien). Asɛm a esii yi maa wɔn ho dwiriw wɔn yiye. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Yesu bɔɔ wɔn ano ketee sɛ wɔnnka asɛm a asi no nkyerɛ obiara, na mmom, wɔmma abofra no aduan nni.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Odiyifo A Onni Anuonyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Yesu fi faako a ɔwɔ hɔ kɔɔ ne kurom a nʼasuafo no ka ne ho. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Ɔkɔɔ hyiadan mu Homeda, fii ase kyerɛkyerɛ maa dodow a wobetiee no ho dwiriw wɔn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">Wobisae se, “Ɛhe na saa onipa yi nyaa saa nneɛma yi, dɛn nyansa na wɔde ama no a nti otumi yɛ anwonwade yi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Ɛnyɛ duadwumfo no ni? Ɛnyɛ Maria babarima a ne nuanom ne Yakobo, Yosef, Yuda ne Simon no ni? Ɛnyɛ yɛne ne nuabeanom na ɛte ha!” Na wɔn bo fuw no.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Odiyifo kurom, nʼabusuafo mu, ne ne fi na onni anuonyam.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Wantumi anyɛ anwonwade ahorow wɔ hɔ, gye ayarefo kakraa bi na ɔde ne nsa guu wɔn so saa wɔn yare. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Gye a wɔannye no anni no yɛɛ no nwonwa.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu Soma Asuafo Dumien No</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Na Yesu kyinkyinii nkuraase kyerɛkyerɛe. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Yesu frɛɛ nʼasuafo dumien no baa ne nkyɛn, na ɔsomaa wɔn baanu baanu, maa wɔn tumi wɔ ahonhommɔne so.<verse eid="MRK 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Akwankyerɛ a ɔde maa wɔn ni, <char style="wj">“Mommfa biribiara nkura gye mo pema nko ara; mommfa aduan anaa kotoku anaa sika.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/><char style="wj">Bio, mommfa mpaboa foforo anaa atade foforo nka nea ɛhyɛ mo yi ho.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/><char style="wj">Baabiara a mobɛkɔ no, montena ofi baako pɛ mu. Monnsesa mo atenae.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ morefi kurow bi a wɔannye anaa wɔantie mo no mu akɔ a, momporoporow mo anan ase tutuw, mfa nni adanse.”</char><verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Asuafo no kɔkaa asɛm no kyerɛɛ obiara a wohyiaa no no sɛ ɔnsakra nʼadwene, ntwe ne ho mfi ne bɔne ho. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Na wotutuu ahonhommɔne bebree, de ngo sraa ayarefo pii saa wɔn yare.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Osuboni Yohane Kum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Ɔhene Herode tee eyi, efisɛ na Yesu din atrɛw. Ebinom kae se, “Osuboni Yohane no na wasan aba nkwa mu bio, enti na otumi yɛ anwonwade a ɔyɛ yi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Ebinom nso susuw sɛ, Yesu yɛ Odiyifo Elia na wasan aba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Afoforo nso kae se, odiyifo foforo bi a ɔte sɛ tete adiyifo akɛse no bi na waba.<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Herode kae se, “Dabi, ɛyɛ Osuboni Yohane a mitwaa ne ti no. Wanyan afi owu mu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Saa bere no na Herode asoma asraafo ma wɔakɔkyere Yohane de no ato afiase, efisɛ na Yohane akasa atia Herode ne Herodia a na ɔyɛ Herode nua Filipo yere no aware. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Osuboni Yohane ka kyerɛɛ Herode se, “Wunni ho kwan sɛ woware wo nua yere.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Asɛm a Yohane kae no anyɛ Herodia nso dɛ, ma onyaa ne ho menasepɔw kae se, ɛsɛ sɛ wokum Yohane. Nanso ɔrentumi nkum no gye sɛ Herode ama no tumi. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Na Herode de obu ma Yohane, efisɛ na onim sɛ ɔyɛ onipa trenee. Eyi nti ɔbɔɔ ne ho ban. Bere biara a Horode ne Yohane bɛkasa no, na ne ho yeraw no nanso eyi nyinaa akyi no, ɔde ntoboase tiee no.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Nea Herodia pɛɛ sɛ ɛnyɛ Yohane no baa mu. Ɛne sɛ, na Herode redi nʼawoda, ma ɔtoo pon wɔ nʼahemfi maa ne mpanyimfo, nʼasafohene ne Galilea mpanyimfo. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22-23"/>Herodia babea bɛsaw kyerɛɛ wɔn ma ɛyɛɛ wɔn nyinaa fɛ. Herode de ntam ka kyerɛɛ ababaa no se, “Bisa me biribiara a wopɛ; sɛ mʼaheman mu fa mpo na wopɛ koraa a, mede bɛma wo!”<verse eid="MRK 6:22-23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Ababaa yi kɔɔ ne na nkyɛn kobisaa no nea ommisa ma ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Bisa no Osuboni Yohane ti!”<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Ababaa yi de ahoɔhare san baa ɔhene no nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no se, “Mepɛ sɛ wode Osuboni Yohane ti to prɛte mu ma me mprempren ara!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Eyi maa ɔhene no werɛ howee, nanso esiane sɛ na waka ntam wɔ nnipa no anim no nti, wammu bɔ a ɔhyɛɛ ne babea no so. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Herode somaa nʼasraafo no mu baako sɛ ɔnkɔ afiase hɔ nkotwa Yohane ti mfa mmrɛ no. Ɔsraani no kotwaa Osuboni Yohane ti, <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>na ɔde too prɛte mu brɛɛ ababaa no ma ɔde kɔmaa ne na. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Bere a Yohane asuafo no tee nea asi no, wɔbɛfaa nʼamu no kosiee no wɔ ɔboda bi mu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ma Nnipa Mpem Anum Aduan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Asomafo no san baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛkaa nea wɔyɛɛ ne nea wɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ nnipa a wɔkɔɔ wɔn nkyɛn no nyinaa kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Yesu tiee wɔn amanneɛ no wiee no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Momma yɛntwe yɛn ho mfi nnipakuw yi ho na yɛnkɔhome kakra.”</char> Nea ɛma ɔkaa saa ne sɛ, na nnipa a wɔba wɔn nkyɛn no to ntwa da. Wonnya kwan mpo na wɔadidi.<verse eid="MRK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo no tenaa ɔkorow mu kɔɔ baabi a obiara nni hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Nanso bere a wɔrekɔ no, nnipa pii huu wɔn ma wotuu mmirika faa mpoano hɔ kotwaa wɔn ho. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Eyi nti bere a Yesu sii fam no, na nnipakuw ahyia wɔ hɔ. Ohuu wɔn no ne yam hyehyee no maa wɔn efisɛ na wɔte sɛ nguan a wonni ɔhwɛfo. Ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn nneɛma bebree a ɛsɛ sɛ wohu.<verse eid="MRK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Onwini reyɛ adwo no, nʼasuafo no baa ne nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no se, “Ade resa. Aduan biara nso nni ha. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Ka kyerɛ nnipa no na wɔnkɔ nkurow mu ne nkuraa a atwa yɛn ho ahyia yi ase, na wɔnkɔtɔ aduan bi nni.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Momma wɔn aduan nni.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Wobisaa no se, “Ansa na yebetumi ama saa nnipa dodow yi aduan no, ɛsɛ sɛ yenya asram asia akatua. Yɛnsɛe sika a ɛte saa mfa mma wɔn brodo nni ana?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Brodo ahe na mowɔ? Monkɔ na monkɔhwɛ.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Wɔsan ba bɛka kyerɛɛ no se, “Wɔwɔ brodo anum ne mpataa abien.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Afei Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nnipakuw no se, wɔntenatena ase, na wɔtenatenaa ase akuwakuw wɔ sare no so. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Wɔtenatenaa ase akuwakuw a bi yɛ ɔha na bi yɛ aduonum. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Yesu faa brodo anum ne mpataa abien no, na ɔhwɛɛ soro, bɔɔ mpae, hyiraa so. Obubuu brodo no mu de maa asuafo no sɛ wɔnkyɛ mma nnipa no. Na ɔkyɛɛ mpataa no nso maa wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Nnipa no dii aduan no maa obiara mee! <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Nnipa a wodii aduan no bɛyɛ mmarima mpem anum; <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>na wɔtasee ase nkae no, ɛyɛɛ nkɛntɛn dumien.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Nantew Asu Ani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Adidi no akyi pɛ, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, wɔnkɔtena ɔkorow no mu, na wonni kan nkɔ Betsaida, na ɔregya nnipakuw no kwan na watiw wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Akyiri no, ɔkɔɔ bepɔw no so kɔbɔɔ mpae.<verse eid="MRK 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Anadwo no a asuafo no te ɔkorow mu adu asu no mfimfini no, na Yesu nko ara na ɔwɔ mpoano. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Ohuu sɛ na wɔn ho akyere wɔn; ɛne sɛ, mframa a ano yɛ den ne asorɔkye bɔ dwiradwiraa ɔkorow no, enti na wɔrebrɛ wɔ ɔkorow no hare mu. Anɔpahema bɛyɛ sɛ nnɔnabiɛsa bere mu no, ɔnantew asu no ani baa wɔn nkyɛn. Ɔyɛɛ sɛ ɔretwa wɔn ho. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Bere a asuafo no huu obi sɛ ɔnam asu no ani no, wɔde ehu teɛteɛɛ mu efisɛ na wosusuw sɛ wɔahu ɔsaman. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Wɔn nyinaa huu no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Ɛhɔ ara, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Momma mo bo ntɔ mo yam. Ɛyɛ me! Munnsuro!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Afei ɔkɔɔ wɔn nkyɛn wɔ ɔkorow no mu no, mframa no gyaee. Asuafo no ho dwiriw wɔn, <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>efisɛ na wɔnte aduanma no ase, na wɔapirim wɔn koma.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Genesaret Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Wotwaa asu no baa Genesaret na woduu hɔ no, wɔde ɔkorow no baa mpoano. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Na wosi fii ɔkorow no mu no, nnipa a wogyinagyina hɔ no huu no. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Wotuu mmirika kyinii nkurow a atwa hɔ ahyia no nyinaa so soaa nnipa a wɔyare deda wɔn akɛtɛ so brɛɛ no wɔ baabiara a wɔtee sɛ ɔwɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Na nkuraa ase anaa nkurow so baabiara a ɔkɔe no, wɔde ayarefo beguu mmɔnten so, srɛɛ no sɛ ɔmma wɔmfa wɔn nsa nka nʼatade ano kɛkɛ. Ayarefo dodow a wotumi de wɔn nsa kaa nʼatade ano no ho yɛɛ wɔn den.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Honhom Fam Ahotew</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Da bi, Farisifo ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo bi a wofi Yerusalem baa Yesu nkyɛn. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Woduu hɔ no, wohuu sɛ nʼasuafo no bi redidi a wɔanhohoro wɔn nsa ho. <verse eid="MRK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Na Yudafo no, ne titiriw no Farisifo nnidi da, gye sɛ wɔahohoro wɔn nsa ho nyinaa, sɛnea wɔn amanne kyerɛ, ansa na wɔadidi. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Na sɛ wofi gua so ba a, wɔhohoro wɔn nsa ansa na wɔadidi. Eyi yɛ mmara bebree a wofi tete adi so no mu baako. Na mmara no bi ne sɛ, wɔhohoro nkuruwa, asɛn ne kɔberesɛn mu.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Enti Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo no bisaa Yesu se, “Adɛn nti na wʼasuafo no nni yɛn amanne a efi tete no so? Efisɛ wodidi a, wonni kan nhohoro wɔn nsa sɛnea amanne kyerɛ no.”<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo nyaatwomfo! Asɛm a Yesaia ka faa mo ho sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Saa nnipa yi de wɔn ano na edi me ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">nanso wɔn koma mmɛn me ho baabiara.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>
    <char style="wj">Wɔsom me kwa;</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn nkyerɛkyerɛ yɛ nnipa nsa ano mmara’</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="wj">yɛ nokware turodoo!</char><verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>
    <char style="wj">Mugyaw Onyankopɔn mmara a wahyehyɛ no de mo ankasa mo amanne si anan mu.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Moahyɛ da sɛ mobɛpo Onyankopɔn mmara no, na moatiatia so, ama mo amanne no atim.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/><char style="wj">Ɛho nhwɛso bi ne sɛ, Mose de Onyankopɔn mmara a ɛka se, ‘Di wʼagya ne wo na ni’ no maa mo.</char> Ɔkae se, <char style="wj">‘obiara a ɔbɛkasa atia nʼagya anaa ne na no, ɛsɛ sɛ wokum no.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/><char style="wj">Nanso moka se, eye sɛ obi bɛka akyerɛ nʼagya anaa ne na a ade bi hia no no se, ‘Merentumi mmoa mo! Efisɛ mede nea anka a ɛsɛ sɛ mede ma mo no ama Onyankopɔn.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/><char style="wj">Enti mubu Onyankopɔn mmara a ɔhyɛe no so, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a mubetumi abɔ mo amanne ho ban.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/><char style="wj">Eyi yɛ nhwɛso baako pɛ. Nanso bebree ka ho.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Afei Yesu frɛɛ nnipakuw no baa ne nkyɛn, ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo nyinaa muntie asɛm a mereka yi yiye, na monte ase.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/><char style="wj">Ade biara a ɛkɔ onipa mu no ngu ne ho fi. Na mmom nea ebefi onipa mu aba no na egu ne ho fi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/><char style="wj">Nea ɔwɔ aso a obetie no ntie.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Afei Yesu fii nnipakuw no mu kɔɔ fie no, nʼasuafo no bisaa no asɛm a ɔkae no ase. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Obisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo nso monte asɛm a mekae no ase? Munhu sɛ, nea mudi no ngu mo ho fi ana?</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/><char style="wj">Efisɛ nea mudi biara no ne mo koma nni hwee yɛ, na mmom ɛfa ɔyafunu no mu kɛkɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Ɔtoaa so se, <char style="wj">“Nea efi onipa mu ba no na egu ne ho fi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/><char style="wj">Afei nea efi nnipa koma mu ba no, ɛde aguamammɔ, korɔn, awudi,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/><char style="wj">ayefasɛm, amumɔyɛ, asisi, ahohwi, anibere, abususɛm, ahantan ne nkwaseasɛm ba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/><char style="wj">Saa nnebɔne yi nyinaa fi onipa mu na ɛba, na ɛno na egu onipa ho fi a ɛmma ɔmfata Onyankopɔn anim.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbea Bi Gyidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Yesu fi hɔ no, ɔkɔɔ Tiro ne Sidon fam pɛɛ sɛ ɔrekɔhyɛ hɔ komm a obiara nte ne nka, nanso anyɛ ye. Da a oduu hɔ ara pɛ, na nkurɔfo tee ne nka sɛ waba hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Ɛhɔ ara na ɔbea bi a honhommɔne hyɛ ne babea ketewa bi mu baa ne nkyɛn. Na wate Yesu nka nti, obebuu no nkotodwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Ɔbea no srɛɛ no sɛ ontu saa honhommɔne no mfi ne ba no mu mma no. Na saa ɔbea yi yɛ Helani a wɔwoo no wɔ Siro-Foinike.<verse eid="MRK 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Ɛsɛ sɛ mma no mee ansa. Na enye sɛ wɔde mma aduan ma akraman.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Ɔbea no nso buae no se, “Owura, ɛyɛ nokware de, nanso ɛyɛ a wɔde aduan a aka wɔ mmofra no prɛte mu no bi ma akraman a wɔhyehyɛ ɔpon no ase no.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Wo mmuae pa no nti masa wo babea no yare. Kɔ fie. Honhommɔne no afi ne mu kɔ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Oduu fie no, ohuu sɛ ne babea no da mpa so dinn a honhommɔne no afi ne mu ampa ara.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mumu Ɔsotifo Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Yesu fi Tiro no, ɔfaa Sidon mansin a emu nkurow yɛ du no so beduu Galilea Po so. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Wɔde ɔsotifo bi a ɔsan yɛ mum brɛɛ no. Wɔn a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa srɛɛ Yesu sɛ, ɔmfa ne nsa nka ɔyarefo no, na ɔnsa no yare.<verse eid="MRK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Yesu soo ne mu de no fii nnipakuw no mu. Afei ɔde ne nsateaa hyɛɛ ɔbarima no asom, tee ntasu de kaa ne tɛkrɛma. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Ɔhwɛɛ ɔsoro, guu ahome teɛɛ mu se, <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Hefata!”</char></char> Ase ne, <char style="wj">“bue!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Amono mu hɔ ara, ɔbarima no aso buei, ne tɛkrɛma sanee, na ofii ase kasae.<verse eid="MRK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Yesu bɔɔ nnipakuw no ano se, wɔmmmɔ asɛm no dawuru nkyerɛ obiara. Nanso mpɛn dodow a ɔbraa wɔn no, na trɛw ara na wɔn nso wɔretrɛw asɛm no mu. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Saa asɛm yi maa wɔn ho dwiriw wɔn yiye. Enti wɔkae se, “Yesu ayɛ ade nyinaa yiye, ɔma asotifo mpo te asɛm, na mum nso kasa!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Nnipa Mpem Anan Aduanma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Saa mmere no mu na nnipakuw foforo bi baa Yesu nkyɛn. Esiane sɛ na hwee nni hɔ a wobedi nti, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>Yesu frɛɛ nʼasuafo no baa ne nkyɛn, na ɔkae se, <char style="wj">“Nnipa yi yɛ me mmɔbɔ. Wɔabedi nnansa wɔ ha a, wonni aduan biara a wobedi bio.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/><char style="wj">Sɛ migya wɔn kwan sɛ wɔnkɔ a wonnidii a, anhwɛ a na wɔn mu bi atotɔ piti wɔ ɔkwan so, efisɛ wɔn mu bi fi akyirikyiri na wɔbae.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Nʼasuafo no bisaa no se, “Ɛhefa na yebenya aduan ama saa nnipa dodow yi wɔ sare yi so ha?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Obisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Brodo dodow ahe na mowɔ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Wobuaa no se, “Yɛwɔ ason.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nnipakuw no se wɔntenatena ase wɔ sare no so. Afei ɔfaa brodo ason no, na ohyiraa so, bubuu mu de maa nʼasuafo no ma wɔkyɛ maa nnipa no. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Na wɔwɔ mpataa kakra wɔ hɔ, nti Yesu hyiraa ɛno nso so de maa asuafo no sɛ wɔnkyɛ ɛno nso mma wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Nnipakuw no didi mee no, ogyaa wɔn kwan. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Nnipa a wodii aduan no dodow bɛyɛ mpem anan. Na wɔtasee ase nnikae no, ɛyɛɛ kɛntɛn ason. <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Eyi akyi no ɔne nʼasuafo no kɔtenaa ɔkorow mu baa Dalmanuta fam.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsoro Nsɛnkyerɛnne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Farisifo no tee sɛ Yesu aba hɔ no, wɔbaa ne nkyɛn bebisabisaa no nsɛm, de sɔɔ no hwɛe. Wɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Yɛ nsɛnkyerɛnne bi kyerɛ yɛn. Ma nsɛnkyerɛnne bi nna adi wɔ wim nkyerɛ yɛn. Ɛno ansa na yebegye wo adi.” <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Yesu tee nea wɔkae no, oguu ahome ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Dɛn nti na mohwehwɛ nsɛnkyerɛnne daa yi? Nsɛnkyerɛnne biara nni hɔ a mɛyɛ akyerɛ mo.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Ɔsan kɔtenaa ɔkorow no mu gyaw wɔn, twa kɔɔ asuogya nohɔ.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Herode Ne Farisifo Mmɔkaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Asuafo no werɛ fii sɛ wɔfa aduan bi kura ansa na wɔkɔ, gye brodo baako pɛ na na wokura wɔ ɔkorow no mu. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Wɔretwa asu no, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho so yiye wɔ Ɔhene Herode ne Farisifo mmɔkaw ho.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Asuafo no bisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho se, “Asɛm a ɔreka yi ase ne dɛn?” Nea wɔn adwene kyerɛɛ wɔn ne sɛ, ebia ɔreka aduan a wɔn werɛ fii sɛ wɔbɛfa akita no ho asɛm.<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Yesu huu nea wodwinnwen no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ ɛno ho asɛm na mereka! Monnte eyi ase ana? Mo koma da so pirim?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/><char style="wj">Mowɔ ani nso munhu ade? Mowɔ aso nso momfa nte asɛm? Na monnkae biribi ana?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/><char style="wj">Bere a mibubuu brodo anum mu maa nnipa mpem anum no, nnikae kɛntɛn ahe na motasee?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Wɔkae se, “Dumien.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na mesan de brodo ason maa nnipa mpem anan no nso, ahe na ɛkae?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Wɔkae se, “Nkɛntɛn ason.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Obisaa wɔn bio se, <char style="wj">“Monnte ase ara ana?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onifuraefo Bi Ayaresa Wɔ Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Bere a woduu Betsaida no, nnipa bi de onifuraefo bi brɛɛ no, srɛɛ no sɛ ɔmfa ne nsa nka no, na ɔnsa no yare. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Yesu soo onifuraefo yi nsa de no kɔɔ akuraa no kurotia. Ɔtee ntasu guu onifuraefo no ani so, na ɔde ne nsa guu no so. Yesu bisaa no se, <char style="wj">“Wuhu ade ana?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Onifuraefo no maa nʼani so hwɛɛ soro, buae se, “Yiw, mihu nnipa! Nanso mihu wɔn sɛ nnua bi na wɔnenam hɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Afei Yesu de ne nsa kataa nʼani no so bio. Onifuraefo no buee nʼani, na bere a ɔrehwɛ ade haa no, nʼani no yɛɛ yiye a afei de na ohu biribiara kann. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Yesu ma ɔkɔɔ fie, na ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Nnsan nnkɔ akuraa no ase bio.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Ka Se Yesu Ne Kristo No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo no fii Galilea kɔɔ Kaesarea ne Filipi nkuraa ase. Wɔnam ɔkwan so rekɔ no, obisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Nnipa ka se mene hena?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Asuafo no buae se, “Ebinom se wone Osuboni Yohane no, na afoforo nso se woyɛ Elia anaasɛ tete adiyifo no mu bi a wasan aba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Na obisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Na mo nso mose meyɛ hena?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petro buaa no se, “Wone Kristo no.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Ɔbɔɔ wɔn kɔkɔ se, wɔnnka nkyerɛ obiara.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Ne Wu Ne Ne Wusɔre Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Afei ofii ase kaa Onipa Ba no amane a obehu ne mpanyimfo, asɔfo mpanyin ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo no po a wɔbɛpo no, na wɔakum no, na nnansa so wasɔre no ho asɛm kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Ɔkaa asɛm no pefee a wamfa biribiara anhintaw wɔn. Petro twee no gyinaa nkyɛn bisaa no se, “Adɛn nti na woka asɛm a ɛte sɛɛ yi?”<verse eid="MRK 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Yesu dan ne ho hwɛɛ nʼasuafo no kaa Petro anim se, <char style="wj">“Fi me so, Ɔbonsam! Wʼadwene yɛ nea efi onipa na ɛnyɛ nea efi Onyankopɔn.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahopaakyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Afei ɔfrɛɛ nʼasuafo no ne nnipakuw no baa ne nkyɛn ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se: <char style="wj">“Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ odi mʼakyi a ɛsɛ sɛ ɔpa ne ho akyi, na ɔsoa nʼasennua, na odi mʼakyi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/><char style="wj">Nea ɔma ne kra som no bo no, ebefi ne nsa. Na nea me ne asɛmpa no nti, ɔbɛhwere ne kra no, wobegye no nkwa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ onipa nya wiase nyinaa na ɔhwere ne kra a mfaso bɛn na obenya?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/><char style="wj">Dɛn na ɛsom bo sen ne kra?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a saa nnabɔne yi mu nʼani wu me ne me nsɛm ho no, ne ho bɛyɛ me, Onipa Ba no aniwu, bere a me ne mʼabɔfo kronkron no bɛsan aba wɔ mʼAgya anuonyam mu no.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Anuonyam Hyerɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Yesu kɔɔ so ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Mo a mugyina ha yi mu bi bɛtena ase akosi sɛ mubehu sɛ, Onyankopɔn ahenni no reba tumi mu!”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Nnansia akyi na Yesu faa Petro, Yakobo ne Yohane de wɔn kɔɔ bepɔw tenten bi atifi. Saa bere no na obiara nka wɔn ho. Ɛhɔ ara na Yesu anuonyam hyerɛn wɔ wɔn anim. <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Nʼatade hyerɛn yɛɛ fitafita sen sɛnea obi betumi ahoro saa atade no ama ayɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Afei Elia ne Mose befii hɔ. Na wɔne Yesu kasae!<verse eid="MRK 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ Yesu se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo, eye sɛ yɛwɔ ha. Yɛbɛbɔ asese abiɛsa wɔ ha, wo de baako, Mose de baako na Elia de baako.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Esiane sɛ na wɔabɔ hu no nti na ɛma ɔkaa saa.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Na omununkum bɛkataa wɔn so. Nne bi fi omununkum no mu kae se, “Oyi ne me Dɔba. Muntie no.”<verse eid="MRK 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Mpofirim a wɔhwɛɛ wɔn ho no, wɔanhu obiara ka Yesu ho.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Wɔresian afi bepɔw no so no, Yesu bɔɔ wɔn ano se wɔnnka nea wɔahu no nkyerɛ obiara kosi sɛ ɔbɛsɔre afi awufo mu. <verse eid="MRK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Asuafo no anka ankyerɛ obiara na mmom, ɛyɛ a na wɔtaa bisabisa wɔn ho wɔn ho se, nʼasɛm a ɔkae se, “Menyan afi awufo mu” no, na ɔkyerɛ dɛn?<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Na nʼasuafo no bisaa no nea enti a mmara no akyerɛkyerɛfo no ka se, ɛsɛ sɛ Elia san ba kan.<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Yesu gye too mu sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ Elia di kan ba bɛtoto nneɛma nyinaa yiye. Ɔkae se, <char style="wj">“Ɛno de, na adɛn nti na wɔakyerɛw se Onipa Ba no behu amane bebree na wɔapo no?</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/><char style="wj">Nanso mise mo sɛ, Elia aba dedaw! Na wɔne no anni no yiye sɛnea adiyifo no hyɛɛ ho nkɔm no.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Abarimaa Bi A Ɔwɔ Honhommɔne Yare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Bere a wosian beduu bepɔw no ase hɔ no, wohuu sɛ nnipakuw atwa asuafo a wɔaka no ho ahyia, na wɔne mmara no akyerɛkyerɛfo no regye wɔn ho wɔn ho akyinnye. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Bere a nnipakuw no huu Yesu no wɔn ho dwiriw wɔn, na wɔde mmirika behyiaa no.<verse eid="MRK 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Akyinnye a na moregye no fa dɛn ho?”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Nnipa no mu baako kae se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo, mede me ba aba ha sɛ sa no yare. Honhommɔne bi a ɛwɔ ne so nti, ontumi nkasa. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Sɛ honhommɔne no ka ne ho wɔ ne mu a, etwa no hwe fam ma nʼano twa ahuru, twɛre ne se a wasinsen. Ɛno nti mesrɛɛ wʼasuafo no se wontu honhommɔne no mfi ne mu, nanso wɔantumi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“O, mo a mo gyidi sua, me ne mo ntena nkosi da bɛn ansa na mo gyidi atim? Momfa abarimaa no mmrɛ me.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Wɔde abarimaa no brɛɛ Yesu. Wɔde no duu Yesu anim ara pɛ na ɔyare no baa denneennen, twaa no hwee fam, ma ɔperee a nʼano refi ahuru.<verse eid="MRK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Yesu bisaa abarimaa no agya se, <char style="wj">“Nnaahe ni a ɔyare yi baa ne so?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Abarimaa no agya buaa Yesu se, “Efi ne mmofraase pɛɛ; <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>na ɛtɔ da bi koraa a, ɔyare no tumi twa no hwe ogya anaa nsu mu pɛ sɛ ekum no. Enti sɛ wubetumi asa no yare de a, hu yɛn mmɔbɔ, na sa no yare ma yɛn.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Yesu bisaa no se, <char style="wj">“Adɛn nti na woka se sɛ metumi a? Nneɛma nyinaa betumi ayɛ hɔ ama obiara a ogye di.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Abarimaa no agya buae se, “Mewɔ gyidi nanso esua, enti boa me, na hyɛ me gyidi mu den!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yesu huu sɛ nnipa no dɔ ara na wɔredɔɔso no, ɔteɛɛ honhommɔne no se, <char style="wj">“Honhommɔne ɔsotifo ne mumu, mehyɛ wo sɛ, fi abofra yi mu kɔ. Nkɔhyɛ ne mu bio!”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Afei ɔyare no baa denneennen ansa na ɛrefi ne mu, enti ɛmaa abarimaa no yɛɛ sɛ owufo. Nnipakuw no kasaa huhuhuhu se, “Wawu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Na Yesu soo ne nsa pagyaw no ma ogyinaa ne nan so a ne ho atɔ no.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Eyi akyi a Yesu ne nʼasuafo no nko ara wɔ fie no, wobisaa no se, “Adɛn nti na yɛn de yɛantumi antu saa honhommɔne no?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mpaebɔ nko ara na ebetumi atu saa ɔyare yi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Wu Ho Nkɔmhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Yesu fii hɔ no ɔfaa Galilea, efisɛ na ɔmpɛ sɛ nnipa te ne nka. <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>Na ɔpɛ sɛ onya bere ma nʼasuafo no de kyerɛkyerɛ wɔn. Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Wobeyi Onipa Ba no ama, na wɔakum no, na ne nnansa so no ɔbɛsɔre aba nkwa mu bio.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Asuafo no ante asɛm a ɔkae yi ase, nanso na wosuro sɛ wobebisa no ase.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hena Ne Ɔkɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo no baa Kapernaum. Bere a woduu ofi a wɔbɛtena mu no mu na wɔregye wɔn ahome no, Yesu bisaa nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Yɛreba no dɛn akyinnye na na moregye wɔ ɔkwan so no?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Asuafo no antumi ammua efisɛ na wɔredwinnwen nea ɔbɛyɛ wɔn mu ɔkɛse no ho.<verse eid="MRK 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Ɔtenaa ase frɛɛ wɔn baa ne nkyɛn ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, “Obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ɔpanyin wɔ mo mu no ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ abofra anaa ɔsomfo wɔ mo mu!”<verse eid="MRK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Afei ɔde abofra ketewa bi begyinaa wɔn mfimfini. Ɔde abofra no kyerɛɛ wɔn kae se, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/><char style="wj">“Mo mu biara a me nti obegye abofra ketewa sɛ oyi no agye me, na nea obegye me no nso agye mʼAgya a ɔsomaa me no.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nea Ontia Yɛn No Wɔ Yɛn Afa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Yohane a ɔyɛ asuafo no mu baako no ka kyerɛɛ Yesu se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo, yehuu ɔbarima bi a ɔde wo din retu ahonhommɔne nti yɛka kyerɛɛ no se onnyae, efisɛ ɔnka yɛn ho.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Yesu kae se, <char style="wj">“Munnsiw no kwan. Efisɛ obiara nni hɔ a ɔreyɛ anwonwade wɔ me din mu na obetwa ne ho atia me.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ontia yɛn no wɔ yɛn afa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/><char style="wj">Obiara a esiane sɛ, moyɛ Kristo de no nti ɔbɛma mo nsu kuruwa ma anom no akatua remmɔ no da.</char><verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti sɛ obi to mmofra nketewa a wogye me di yi mu bi hintidua a, eye ma no sɛ anka wɔde ɔbotan duruduru bɛsɛn ne kɔn mu, atow no akyene po mu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wo nsa ma woyɛ bɔne a, twa na tow kyene. Eye ma wo sɛ wode dɛmdi bɛkɔ nkwa mu sen sɛ, wɔde wo nipadua nyinaa bɛto amanehunu gya</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/><char style="wj">a ennum da no mu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wo nan ma woyɛ bɔne a, twa na tow kyene. Eye ma wo sɛ wode nansin bɛkɔ nkwa mu sen sɛ, wode nan abien bɛkɔ amanehunu gya</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/><char style="wj">a ennum da no mu.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wʼani ma woyɛ bɔne a, tu na tow kyene. Eye ma wo sɛ wode ani baako bɛkɔ Onyankopɔn ahenni mu sen sɛ wowɔ ani abien na wɔde wo bɛto amanehunu gya mu</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/><char style="wj">baabi a</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘ogya no ennum da</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <char style="wj">na ɛhɔ asunson nso nwu da.’</char><verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>
    <char style="wj">Na wɔde ogya bɛhyɛ wɔn nyinaa nkyene.</char><verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nkyene yɛ dɛ, nanso sɛ nkyene yera ne dɛ a, ɛso nni mfaso bio; wonte ne dɛ wɔ biribiara mu. Enti monnyera mo dɛ. Mo ne mo ho mo ho ntena asomdwoe mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Awaregyae Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Afei Yesu fii Galilea twa baa Yudea fam nohɔ wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan agya. Nnipakuw baa ne nkyɛn, na sɛnea ɔtaa yɛ no ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Farisifo bi baa ne nkyɛn bebisaa no se, “Wopene awaregyae so ana?” Wobisaa no eyi de sɔɔ no hwɛe.<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Dɛn na Mose ka faa awaregyae ho?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Wobuae se, “Mose kaa se eye sɛ wogyae aware. Nʼasɛm a ɔkae ne sɛ, sɛ ɔbarima bi pɛ sɛ ogyaa ne yere aware a ɔnkyerɛw awaregyae krataa mfa mma ne yere no.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Adɛn nti na ɔkaa saa? Merebɛkyerɛ mo nea enti a ɔkaa saa. Esiane mo koma a apirim no nti na ɔkaa saa kyerɛɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/><char style="wj">Nanso eyi mfi Onyankopɔn. Efi adebɔ mfiase na Onyankopɔn bɔɔ ɔbarima ne ɔbea kaa wɔn bɔɔ mu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/><char style="wj">Eyi nti na ɔbarima begyaw nʼagya ne ne na,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/><char style="wj">na ɔde ne ho akɔbɔ ne yere ho, na wɔn baanu no ayɛ ɔhonam koro.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/><char style="wj">Na nea Onyankopɔn aka abɔ mu no, ɛnsɛ sɛ onipa tetew mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Akyiri a na ɔne nʼasuafo no wɔ fie no, asuafo no bisaa no saa asɛm koro no ara bio. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Obuaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Sɛ obi gyaa ne yere aware na ɔsan ware obi foforo a na wabɔ aguaman.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔyere gyaa ne kunu aware na ɔsan ware a, na ɔno nso abɔ aguaman saa ara.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyira Mmofra Nkumaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Na awofo bi de mmofra nkumaa brɛɛ Yesu se onhyira wɔn, nanso nʼasuafo no pampam wɔn a wɔde mmofra no bae no, ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, wɔnnhaw no. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Yesu huu nea nʼasuafo no ayɛ no, anyɛ no dɛ na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Momma mmofra no kwan na wɔmmra me nkyɛn, na munnsiw wɔn kwan, na eyinom sɛɛ na Onyankopɔn ahenni no yɛ wɔn dea.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo se, obiara a ɔrennye Onyankopɔn ahenni no sɛ abofra no, ɔrentumi nhyɛn mu.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Na ɔyɛɛ wɔn atuu, de ne nsa guu wɔn so hyiraa wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adefo Ne Ɔsoro Ahenni No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Na osii mu sɛ ɔrekɔ baabi foforo no, ɔbarima bi tutuu mmirika baa ne nkyɛn bebuu no nkotodwe bisaa no se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo pa, dɛn na menyɛ na manya nkwa a enni awiei?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yesu bisaa no se <char style="wj">“Adɛn na wofrɛ me papa? Obiara nyɛ papa gye ɔbaako; ɔne Onyankopɔn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/><char style="wj">Ɛfa wʼasɛmmisa no ho nso, wunim mmaransɛm no: ‘Mmɔ aguaman! Nni awu! Mmɔ korɔn! Nni adansekurum! Di wʼagya ne wo na ni!’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Aberante no ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo, eyinom nyinaa mifi me mmofraase na midii so.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yesu hwɛɛ aberante yi dinn, nyaa ɔdɔ bi maa no. Ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Aka wo ade baako. Kɔ na kɔtɔn biribiara a wowɔ, na fa sika no ma ahiafo, na wubenya agyapade wɔ ɔsoro, na bra bedi mʼakyi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Aberante no tee saa asɛm no nʼanim sesae, na ɔde awerɛhow kɔe, efisɛ na ɔwɔ ahonyade bebree.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Ɔrekɔ no, Yesu hwɛɛ no na ɔdan ne ho ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ den ma ɔdefo sɛ ɔbɛkɔ Onyankopɔn ahenni mu!”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Asɛm a Yesu kaa no maa asuafo no ho dwiriw wɔn. Yesu san kaa bio se, <char style="wj">“Me mma, sɛ moahu den a ɛyɛ ma wɔn a wɔwɔ ahonyade sɛ wɔbɛkɔ Onyankopɔn ahenni mu?</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/><char style="wj">Na ɛyɛ mmerɛw sɛ yoma bɛfa pane aniwa mu sen sɛ ɔdefo bɛkɔ Onyankopɔn ahenni mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Asuafo no ho dwiriw wɔn mmoroso na wobisaa no se, “Ɛno de, na hena na wobegye no nkwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yesu hwɛɛ wɔn dinn kae se, <char style="wj">“Onipa fam de, ɛyɛ den, na Onyankopɔn fam de, biribiara betumi aba mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Akyidi Mu Akatua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Afei Petro fii ase kenkan nneɛma a ɔne asuafo no agyaw abedi Yesu akyi. Ɔkae se, “Yagyaw biribiara abedi wʼakyi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yesu nso buaa no se, <char style="wj">“Merema mo ate ase sɛ, obi nni hɔ a me nti wagyaw ofi, nuabarimanom, nuabeanom, ɛna, agya ne mma anaasɛ agyapade a ɔbɛkɔ akɔka Asɛmpa no,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/><char style="wj">na ɔrennya ofi, nuabarimanom, nuabeanom, ɛnanom, mma ne nsase mmɔho ɔha, na ɔrennya ɔtaa nso nka ho! Eyinom nyinaa bɛyɛ ne dea wɔ asase yi so, na wiase a ɛreba no mu de, obenya nkwa a enni awiei.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/><char style="wj">Na adikanfo pii bedi akyi, na akyikafo abedi kan.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Wu Ne Ne Wusɔre Ho Nkɔmhyɛ A Ɛto So Abien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Afei wosii mu sɛ wɔrekɔ Yerusalem a na Yesu di wɔn kan; na bere a asuafo no di nʼakyi no, ehu ne osuro kaa wɔn. Yesu twee wɔn gyinaa nkyɛn, na ɔsan kaa nneɛma a sɛ wodu Yerusalem a ɛbɛba ne so no nyinaa kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Sɛ yedu hɔ a wobeyi me, Onipa Ba no ama asɔfo mpanyin ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo, na wɔabu me kumfɔ, na wɔde me ahyɛ Roma aban nsa, na wɔakum me.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/><char style="wj">Wobedi me ho fɛw, na wɔatete ntasu agu me so, na wɔde mpire atwa me mmaa, na wɔakum me, na nnansa so no, masɔre bio.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo Ne Yohane Abisade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Afei Sebedeo mma Yakobo ne Yohane baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo, yɛpɛ sɛ woyɛ yɛn adɔe bi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Dɛn na mopɛ sɛ meyɛ ma mo?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Wobuae se, “Ma yɛn mu baako ntena wo nifa so, na ɔbaako nso ntena wo benkum so wɔ wʼahenni mu hɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Yesu maa wɔn mmuae se, <char style="wj">“Munnim nea mubisa no! Mubetumi anom awerɛhow kuruwa nwenweenwen a ɛsɛ sɛ menom ano no ana? Anaasɛ mubetumi ama wɔde amanehunu asubɔ no abɔ mo asu?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Wɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Yebetumi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Na Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mubetumi anom me kuruwa ano, na wɔde asubɔ a wɔde bɔ me no abɔ mo;</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/><char style="wj">nanso minni tumi sɛ miyi wɔn a wɔbɛtena me nifa anaa me benkum so no. Onyankopɔn nko ara na ɔde saa afa no bɛma wɔn a wɔasiesie hɔ ama wɔn no.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Asuafo a wɔaka no tee nea Yakobo ne Yohane kobisaa no, anyɛ wɔn dɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Enti Yesu frɛɛ wɔn ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Munim sɛ ahene ne atumfo a wɔwɔ wiase no di wɔn a wɔhyɛ wɔn ase no so,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/><char style="wj">nanso mo de, ɛnte saa wɔ mo ho. Obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ɔkɛse wɔ mo mu no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ mo somfo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ne nuanom so panyin no ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ wɔn nyinaa akoa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no amma sɛ wɔnsom no, na mmom ɔbɛsomee, na ɔde ne kra too hɔ sɛ mpata maa nnipa nyinaa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onifuraefo Bi Adehu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo no beduu Yeriko. Wɔrefi kurow no mu no, nnipakuw tu dii wɔn akyi. Saa bere a Yesu retwa mu no, na onifuraefo Bartimeo a ne din nkyerɛase ne “Timoteo ba” no te kwankyɛn resrɛsrɛ ade. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Bere a Bartimeo tee sɛ Yesu Nasareni na ɔretwam no, ofii ase teɛteɛɛ mu se, “Dawid Ba Yesu, hu me mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Nnipa no bi teɛteɛɛ no se, “Mua wʼano!” Nanso ɔkɔɔ so teɛteɛɛ mu dennen se, “Dawid ba, hu me mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Bere a Yesu tee ne nne no, ogyina kae se, <char style="wj">“Momfrɛ no mma me.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Wɔfrɛɛ onifuraefo no ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Ma wo bo ntɔ wo yam, sɔre na ɔrefrɛ wo!” <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Bartimeo tow ne ntama gui, sɔre baa Yesu nkyɛn.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yesu bisaa no se, <char style="wj">“Dɛn na wopɛ sɛ meyɛ ma wo?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Onifuraefo no buae se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo, mepɛ sɛ mihu ade!”<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Kɔ, na wo gyidi agye wo.”</char> Na ntɛm ara onifuraefo no huu ade, na odii Yesu akyi.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kɔ Yerusalem Sɛ Ɔhene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo no rebɛn Yerusalem, na woduu Betfage ne Betania a ɛwɔ Ngo Bepɔw no ho no, ɔsomaa nʼasuafo no mu baanu dii wɔn anim kan. <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monkɔ akuraa a ɛwɔ hɔ no ase. Sɛ mudu hɔ a, mubehu sɛ wɔasa afurum ba bi a wɔntenaa ne so da hama. Monsan no na momfa no mmrɛ me.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ obi bisa mo se dɛn na moreyɛ a, monka no tiaa se, ‘Ne ho hia Awurade, na ɔbɛsan de no aba mprempren ara.’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Asuafo baanu no sii mu. Wokohuu sɛ aboa no sa ofi bi abobow ano. Enti wɔsan no. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Wogu so resan no no, nnipa bi a wogyina nkyɛn bisaa wɔn se, “Adɛn nti na moresan afurum ba no?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Wɔkaa asɛm a Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn no kyerɛɛ nnipa no ma wɔtee wɔn ase. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Wɔde afurum ba no brɛɛ Yesu maa asuafo no de wɔn ntama guu aboa no so, maa Yesu tenaa no so. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Nnipakuw a wɔwɔ hɔ no bi de wɔn ntama sesɛw ɔkwan a ɔde aboa no nam so no so. Ebinom nso pempan nnua mman de sesɛw ɔkwan no mu saa ara. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Na Yesu di nnipakuw no mfimfini a wɔn nyinaa reteɛteɛ mu se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hosiana!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkamfo</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Nhyira ne nea ɔnam Awurade din mu reba!”<verse eid="MRK 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>“Anuonyam nka Onyankopɔn sɛ yɛn agya Dawid ahenni reba.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:10"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">“Hosiana wɔ sorosoro!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yesu koduu Yerusalem no, ɔkɔɔ asɔredan no mu. Ɔhwɛɛ biribiara a ɛwɔ hɔ dinn ansa na ɔrefi hɔ, efisɛ, na onwini redwo enti ɔne asuafo dumien no kɔɔ Betania.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Dome Borɔdɔma Dua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Ade kyee anɔpa a wɔrefi Betania hɔ no, ɔkɔm dee no. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Wɔkɔɔ kakra no, ohuu sɛ borɔdɔma dua bi si hɔ a ayɛ kusuu. Ɔkɔɔ hɔ kɔhwɛɛ sɛ aduaba no bi wɔ so ana. Nanso oduu hɔ no ohuu sɛ nhaban nko ara na ɛwɔ so. Saa bere no nso na ɛnyɛ bere a ɛsɛ sɛ borɔdɔma no sow. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Yesu domee borɔdɔma dua no se, <char style="wj">“Efi nnɛ, worensow aba bio!”</char> Asuafo no tee asɛm a ɔkae no.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kɔ Hyiadan Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Yesu san baa Yerusalem no, ɔkɔɔ hyiadan mu hɔ. Oduu hɔ no, ɔpam aguadifo a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa, kaa sikasesafo apon nyinaa guu fam, bubuu pata a wɔtɔn mmorɔnoma wɔ mu no nyinaa, <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>siw kwan sɛ obiara mmedi gua wɔ hɔ bio. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Kyerɛwsɛm no ka se, ‘Mʼasɔrefi yɛ beae a wɔbɔ mpae,’ nanso mo de, mode hɔ ayɛ akorɔmfo atenae.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyimfo tee nea Yesu ayɛ no, wɔbɔɔ ne ho pɔw, pɛɛ ɔkwan a wɔbɛfa so ayi no afi hɔ. Asɛm a na ɛhaw wɔn ne sɛ, sɛ wɔanhwɛ no yiye nso a, ɛde basabasayɛ bɛba, efisɛ na nnipa bebree agye Yesu nkyerɛkyerɛ no ato mu.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Sɛnea na wɔtaa yɛ no, anwummere no ara, wofii kurow no mu.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Borɔdɔma Dua A Ewui No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Anɔpa a asuafo no retwa mu wɔ borɔdɔma dua a Yesu domee no no ho no, wuhuu sɛ awu. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Petro kaee asɛm a Yesu ka de domee dua no no, ɔteɛɛ mu se, “Hwɛ, Kyerɛkyerɛfo! Borɔdɔma dua a wodomee no no awu!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Yesu nso ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Sɛ mowɔ gyidi wɔ Onyankopɔn mu a,</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/><char style="wj">anka mubetumi aka akyerɛ Ngo Bepɔw yi se, ‘Tutu kogu po mu,’ na ebetutu akogu mu nso. Munnye nni; mommma mo gyidi nhinhim.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/><char style="wj">Muntie nea mereka yi. Biribiara a mubebisa wɔ mpaebɔ mu no, munnye nni sɛ mo nsa aka, na ɛbɛyɛ hɔ ama mo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ morebɔ mpae a, nea edi kan no, sɛ mowɔ obi ho asɛm a momfa nkyɛ no sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no nso de mo bɔne bɛkyɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ moamfa bɔne ankyɛ a, saa ara na mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no nso remfa mo bɔne nkyɛ mo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tumi Ho Nsɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Wɔbaa Yerusalem bio. Wɔkɔɔ hyiadan mu hɔ no, asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin baa ne nkyɛn bebisaa no se, <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>“Tumi bɛn na wugyinaa so pam aguadifo no?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Yesu nso buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Merebebisa mo asɛm baako bi na mummua me!</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/><char style="wj">Onyankopɔn na ɔsomaa Osuboni Yohane, anaa ɛnyɛ ɔno? Mummua me!”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Wodwinnwen ho kae se, “Sɛ yɛka se, Onyankopɔn na ɔsomaa no a, wobebisa yɛn nea enti a yɛannye nea Yohane kae no anni. <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Na sɛ yɛka se ɛnyɛ Onyankopɔn na ɔsomaa no nso a, dɔm no bɛhaw yɛn. Efisɛ wɔn nyinaa nim sɛ Yohane yɛ odiyifo.”<verse eid="MRK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Enti wɔn mmuae a wɔmae ara ne sɛ, “Yɛrentumi mmua. Yennim.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Ɛhɔ ara na Yesu nso ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Sɛ munnim de a, me nso meremma mo asɛmmisa no ho mmuae!”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Bobeturo Mu Akuafo Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Yesu nam mmebu so kasa kyerɛɛ nnipa no se: <char style="wj">“Okuafo bi yɛɛ bobeturo, gyee ban faa ho, na otuu amoa a wokyi bobe mu nsu wɔ mu, sii ɔwɛn aban wɔ mu. Afei ɔde afuw no gyaw akuafo bi tuu kwan.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/><char style="wj">Eduu bere a bobe no bere a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtew no, ɔsomaa ne ho nipa bi se onkogye ne kyɛfa mmrɛ no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/><char style="wj">Nanso akuafo no boroo no, ma ɔde ne nsa pan san kɔe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/><char style="wj">Okuafo no san somaa onipa foforo kɔɔ wɔn nkyɛn, na ɔno nso, wɔboroo no, pirapiraa no sen nea odi kan no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/><char style="wj">Onipa a ɔsomaa no bio no de, wokum no. Afoforo a akyiri no wɔkɔe no nso, wɔhwee ebinom, na wokum ebinom nso.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso na aka ɔbaako a ɔyɛ ne ba a ɔdɔ no. Ɔsomaa ɔno nso kɔɔ wɔn nkyɛn, susuw sɛ wɔbɛfɛre no de nidi ama no.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso bere a akuafo no huu no sɛ ɔreba no, wɔkae se, ‘Ɔdedifo no na ɔreba no. Momma yenkum no, na agyapade no ayɛ yɛn de!’</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/><char style="wj">Wɔkyeree no kum no, twee no fii bobe turo mu hɔ kɔtow no kyenee baabi.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mugye di sɛ, sɛ afuw wura no ba a dɛn na ɔbɛyɛ akuafo no? Ɔbɛba abekum wɔn, na ɔde afuw no ama nnipa foforo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/><char style="wj">Monnkenkan eyi wɔ Kyerɛwsɛm no mu pɛn se:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Ɔbo a adansifo apo no,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">ɛno ara na abɛyɛ dan no twea so tibo;</char><verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Awurade na wayɛ eyi,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">
    <char style="wj">na ɛyɛ nwonwa wɔ yɛn ani so?’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Na esiane saa bɛ a obui no nti, Yudafo mpanyin no pɛɛ sɛ wɔkyere no, efisɛ wuhuu sɛ wɔn ho asɛm na ɔreka no a ɛkyerɛ sɛ, wɔne saa akuafo atirimɔdenfo no. Nanso na wosuro dɔm no. Eyi ma wogyaa no, na wofii hɔ kɔe.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Towtua Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Wɔsomaa Farisifo ne Herodefo bi baa Yesu nkyɛn sɛ wɔne no mmɛkasa, na wɔnam nʼanom asɛm so anya no akyere no. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Wobisaa no se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo, yenim sɛ woyɛ ɔnokwafo a wotaa ka nokware. Nea onipa ka no ntumi nnan wʼadwene. Afei wokyerɛkyerɛ nnipa Onyankopɔn akwan. Yɛpɛ sɛ yebisa wo se, eye sɛ woyi tow ma Roma Hempɔn Kaesare<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na ɛyɛ asɛde sɛ ɔmanfo tua tow ma Romahene. Na towgye nsɔ ani koraa nti Yudafo no bi ampɛ sɛ wobetua, efisɛ na wogye di sɛ tow no tua no na ɛnyɛ Roma den ma wodi ɔman no so.</char></note> anaa enye?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Yesu huu wɔn adwemmɔne no kae se, <char style="wj">“Adɛn nti na mosɔ me hwɛ, momfa sika a wɔde yi tow no bi nkyerɛ me, na mɛma mo mmuae.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Wɔde maa no ma obisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Hena mfoni ne nkyerɛw na ɛwɔ so?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Wobuae se, “Kaesare de.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Ɛno de momfa Kaesare de mma no, na momfa Onyankopɔn de mma Onyankopɔn!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Ne mmuae no maa wɔn ho dwiriw wɔn.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Owusɔre Mu Aware Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Sadukifo a wɔka se owusɔre nni hɔ no baa ne nkyɛn bebisaa no se, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>“Kyerɛkyerɛfo, Mose yɛɛ mmara maa yɛn se, sɛ ɔbarima bi anwo na owu a, ne nuabarima mfa ne yere no kunabea na ɔne no nwo mma mma owufo no. <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Anuanom baason bi tenaa ase. Nea odi kan no waree yere a, ɔne no anwo na owui. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Nea ɔto so abien no nso waree okunafo no, na ɔno nso ankyɛ na owui a ɔne no anwo. Na nea ɔto so abiɛsa no nso waree no a, ɔne no anwo na owui. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Eyi kɔɔ so kosii sɛ anuanom yi nyinaa waree ɔbea no, na ɔbea no nso wui. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Nea yɛpɛ sɛ yehu ne sɛ, owusɔre mu, sɛ wonya sɔre a, wɔn mu hena na ɔbea no bɛyɛ ne yere?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo mfomso a moyɛ no fi nim a munnim Kyerɛwsɛm no, ne Onyankopɔn tumi a ɔwɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/><char style="wj">Sɛ anuanom baason yi ne ɔbea no sɔre fi awufo mu a, wɔrenware; wɔbɛyɛ sɛ abɔfo a wɔwɔ ɔsoro no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/><char style="wj">Afei nea ɛfa awufo nyan no ho nso, monkenkan Mose nhoma no mu asɛm a ɛfa Mose ne nwura a na ɛhyew no ho da? Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, ‘Mene Abraham Nyankopɔn, Isak Nyankopɔn ne Yakob Nyankopɔn.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/><char style="wj">Na Onyankopɔn reka akyerɛ Mose se, ɛwɔ mu sɛ saa nnipa yi awuwu mfe pii a atwam no de, nanso wɔte ase. Ɛnte saa a anka ɔrenka se ɔyɛ ateasefo Nyankopɔn, na ɔnyɛ awufo Nyankopɔn. Moayɛ mfomso kɛse.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo no mu baako a ogyina hɔ retie no huu sɛ, wabua wɔn sɛnea ɛfata no, obisaa no se, “Mose mmaransɛm no mu nea ɛwɔ he na ɛkyɛn ne nyinaa?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yesu buaa no se, <char style="wj">“Nea ɛkyɛn ne nyinaa ne nea ɛka se, ‘Israel, tie! Awurade, yɛn Nyankopɔn yɛ Awurade koro;</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/><char style="wj">na dɔ Awurade wo Nyankopɔn fi wo koma ne wo kra ne wʼadwene ne wʼahoɔden nyinaa mu,’ no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/><char style="wj">Na nea ɛto so abien no ne: ‘Dɔ wo yɔnko sɛ wo ho.’ Mmaransɛm bi nni hɔ a ɛkyɛn eyinom.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Kyerɛwsɛm no kyerɛkyerɛfo no buaa no se, “Owura, woaka nokware sɛ, Onyankopɔn baako pɛ na ɔwɔ hɔ, na obi foforo nka ne ho, <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>na minim nso sɛ, sɛ mɛdɔ no afi me koma ne mʼadwene ne mʼahoɔden nyinaa mu, na mɛdɔ me yɔnko sɛ me ho no, sen afɔre biara a wɔbɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Yesu huu sɛ wabua asɛm no nyansa mu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Wo ne Onyankopɔn ahenni ntam kwan nware.”</char> Na saa asɛm yi akyi no, obi antumi ammisa no asɛm biara bio.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onipa Ba No Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Bere bi a Yesu rekyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔredan mu no, obisaa nnipa no se, <char style="wj">“Adɛn na Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo no ka se, ɛsɛ sɛ Agyenkwa no yɛ Ɔhene Dawid ba?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/><char style="wj">Efisɛ Dawid ankasa nam Honhom Kronkron mu kae se,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Awurade ka kyerɛɛ me wura se:</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">“Tena me nifa so</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">kosi sɛ mede wʼatamfo</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">bɛyɛ wo nan ntiaso.” ’</char><verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>
    <char style="wj">Sɛ Dawid frɛ no ‘Awurade’ a, ɛyɛɛ dɛn na Kristo no yɛ ne ba?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Ɔkwan a ɔfaa so kasaa no maa nnipa no de anigye tiee no.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara Akyerɛkyerɛfo No Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Bere bi a nnipakuw bi de anigye retie Yesu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho yiye wɔ Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo ho! Wɔhyɛ ntade akɛse sɛ asikafo na sɛ wɔnam bagua mu a, wɔpɛ sɛ obiara a ohyia wɔn no de obu kyia wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wɔkɔ hyiadan mu a wɔtenatena mpanyin agua so, na sɛ wɔkɔ adidi ase a, wɔtena mpanyin tenabea.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/><char style="wj">Wɔbɔ mpae atenten ma nnipa hu sɛ wɔresom Onyankopɔn, nanso wosisi akunafo. Eyi nti wobenya asotwe a emu yɛ duru.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbea Kunafo Bi Afɔrebɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Da bi a Yesu kɔɔ asɔredan mu no, ɔkɔtenaa afɔrebɔ adaka a esi hɔ no anim hwɛɛ sɛnea nkurɔfo no de sika regu adaka no mu. Asikafo no de sika a ɛdɔɔso guu mu. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Ɔbea kunafo hiani bi nso bae, na ɔde sika nketewa abien beguu mu.<verse eid="MRK 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Ɔfrɛɛ nʼasuafo no baa ne nkyɛn ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Saa ɔbea kunafo hiani yi afɔre a ɔbɔe no dɔɔso sen asikafo no nyinaa afɔrebɔde.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/><char style="wj">Na wɔn nyinaa fi nea wɔanya ama abu wɔn so no mu na woyiyii bi de bae, na ɔbea yi de, ofi ne hia mu de nea ɔwɔ nyinaa na abegu mu no.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɔredan No Sɛe Ne Awieimmere No Nsɛnkyerɛnne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Yesu refi asɔredan no mu hɔ no, nʼasuafo no mu baako kae se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo, adan yi yɛ fɛ papa. Hwɛ sɛnea wɔde abo asiesie afasu no.”<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ nokware de, nanso wobedwiriw saa dan yi agu pasaa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Bere a ɔte Ngo Bepɔw no so a nʼani tua Yerusalem no, Petro, Yakobo, Yohane ne Andrea baa ne nkyɛn bebisaa no se, <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>“Bere bɛn na nea woreka fa asɔredan yi ho no bɛba mu. Na nsɛnkyerɛnne bi bedi kan aba ansa ana?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ yiye na obi annaadaa mo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/><char style="wj">Nnipa bebree de me din bɛba abɛka se wɔne Agyenkwa no, na wɔadaadaa mo mu pii.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/><char style="wj">Akokoakoko besisi mmaa nyinaa, nanso ɛnyɛ ɛno ne awiei no ho nsɛnkyerɛnne.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/><char style="wj">Aman bɛsɔre aman so, na ahenni asɔre ahenni so na asasewosow ne ɔkɔm bɛba mmeaemmeae. Eyinom nyinaa bɛyɛ nneɛma a ɛyɛ hu a ɛbɛba no mfiase.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso sɛ eyinom fi ase sɛ ɛreba a, monhwɛ yiye! Mobɛkɔ ɔhaw akɛse mu. Esiane sɛ mudi mʼakyi nti, wɔbɛtwe mo akɔ asennii; wɔbɛhwe mo wɔ asɔredan mu, na wɔaka nsɛm agu mo so wɔ ahemfo ne mpanyimfo anim. Saa bere no ne bere pa a ɛsɛ sɛ moka Asɛmpa no kyerɛ wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/><char style="wj">Na ɛsɛ sɛ Asɛmpa no di kan du ɔman biara so ansa na awiei no aba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wɔkyere mo de mo begyina asennii a, munninwene nea mobɛka de ayi mo ho ano ho. Monka nea Onyankopɔn bɛkyerɛ mo sɛ monka no. Na ɛnyɛ mo na mobɛkasa, na Honhom Kronkron no na ɔbɛkyerɛ mo nea monka.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Onua beyi onua ama sɛ wonkum no; agyanom nso beyi wɔn mma ama; mma nso beyi wɔn awofo ama sɛ wonkum wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/><char style="wj">Na esiane sɛ moyɛ me de nti, nnipa nyinaa bɛtan mo. Nanso wɔn a wobegyina pintinn akodu awiei no, wobegye wɔn nkwa.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti sɛ muhu akyiwade a ɛbɔ ɔman wɔ asɔredan mu hɔ a, ɔkenkanfo, hwɛ yiye! Wɔn a wɔwɔ Yudea no nguan nkɔ mmepɔw no so.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔwɔ wɔn afi mu no nguan a wɔnnsan nnkɔ fie hɔ bio nkɔfa biribiara mmfi hɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔwɔ mfuw mu no nso nnsan wɔn akyi mmɛfa sika anaa ntama wɔ fie.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/><char style="wj">Na wɔn a wɔafa afuru ne wɔn a woturu mma saa bere no mu no nnue.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/><char style="wj">Na mommɔ mpae na bere a ɛsɛ sɛ muguan no anyɛ awɔw bere.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/><char style="wj">Na ahohia a ɛbɛba saa mmere no mu no, efi bere a Onyankopɔn bɔɔ ade no bi nsii da, na bi nso rensi da.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Gye sɛ Awurade twa saa amanehunu no so, anyɛ saa a ɔkra baako koraa rentena ase. Nanso esiane wɔn a wɔayi wɔn no nti, obetwa nna no so.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ obi ka kyerɛ mo se, ‘Agyenkwa no ni’ a, mummmua.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/><char style="wj">Atoro agyenkwanom ne atoro adiyifo bɛsɔre wɔ mo mu na wɔayɛ anwonwade ahorow, na sɛ ebetumi a, wɔadaadaa Onyankopɔn no ankasa ara mma.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/><char style="wj">Monhwɛ yiye, efisɛ maka biribiara akyerɛ mo!</char><verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ahohia no akyi no,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘owia beduru sum,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">na ɔsram renhyerɛn,</char><verse eid="MRK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>
    <char style="wj">na nsoromma bɛtetew ahwe,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">
    <char style="wj">na wɔbɛwosow wim abɔde ahorow no.’</char><verse eid="MRK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na nnipa nyinaa behu me, Agyenkwa no, sɛ mede tumi ne anuonyam nam omununkum mu reba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/><char style="wj">Na mɛsoma mʼabɔfo akɔ wiase mmaa nyinaa, fi ɔsoro ano akɔka asase ano, na wɔabɛboaboa wɔn a mayi wɔn no ano.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei munsua biribi mfi borɔdɔma dua no ho asɛm no mu. Sɛ eyi mman foforo, san yi nhaban foforo a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ asusow abɛn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/><char style="wj">Sɛ muhu sɛ saa nneɛma yi a maka ho asɛm akyerɛ mo yi nyinaa afi ase resisi a, mubehu sɛ me ba a mɛsan aba no abɛn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/><char style="wj">Nokware mise mo sɛ, awo ntoatoaso yi rentwa mu, gye sɛ saa nneɛma yi nyinaa aba mu ansa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/><char style="wj">Ɔsoro ne asase betwa mu akɔ, nanso me nsɛm de, ɛrentwa mu da.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso da anaa dɔn ko a awiei no bɛba de, obiara nnim. Ɔsoro abɔfo ne me ankasa mpo nnim. Agya no nko ara na onim.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/><char style="wj">Esiane sɛ munnim bere ko a asɛm yi besi nti, munsiesie mo ho. Monwɛn, ntwɛn me ba no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/><char style="wj">Me ba no te sɛ ɔbarima bi a otuu kwan kɔɔ ɔman foforo bi so. Ɔrebɛkɔ no, ɔkyɛɛ adwuma maa ne nkoa. Na ɔka kyerɛɛ ne ɔwɛmfo nso se, ɔnwɛn hɔ yiye nkosi sɛ ɔbɛba.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti mo nso monwɛn, efisɛ munnim bere ko a ofiwura no bɛba. Ebetumi aba sɛ ɔbɛba anwummere, ɔdasu mu, ahemadakye anaa awia.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ofu mu ba a, ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔbɛto mo sɛ moadeda.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/><char style="wj">Asɛm a mede agyaw mo ne nnipa nyinaa ni. ‘Monwɛn!’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔɔ Yesu Ho Pɔw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Aka nnaanu na Twam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛyɛ afahyɛ bi a wɔde kae bere a Awurade bɔfo betwaa mu faa Hebrifo anim na okunkum wɔn abakan sɛnea ɔyɛɛ wɔ Misraimfo afi mu no. (Hwɛ <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:11">2 Mose 12.11</ref></char>)</char></note> ne Apiti Afahyɛ a ɛyɛ Yudafo ahomegye nna no adu no, asɔfo mpanyin ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo no hwehwɛɛ nyansa kwan a wɔbɛfa so akyere Yesu, akum no. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Nanso wɔkae se, “Yɛrenkyere no afahyɛ no mu, anyɛ saa a ɛde basabasayɛ bɛba ɔman no mu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsra Yesu Ngo Wɔ Betania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Yesu wɔ Betania na ɔne Simon kwatani redidi no, ɔbea bi a okura ngo huamhuam bi a ne bo yɛ den baa hɔ. Otuu ano, hwie guu Yesu tirim.<verse eid="MRK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Nea ɔbea yi yɛe no anyɛ nnipa a wɔte adidii no mu bi dɛ. Na wɔkae se wasɛe ngo no kwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Wɔkaa bio nso se, “Anka wobetumi atɔn ngo huamhuam yi anya sika pii na wɔde ama ahiafo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Nanso Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Munnyaa no! Adɛn nti na morehaw no wɔ ade pa a ɔyɛe no ho?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/><char style="wj">Mo ne ahiafo a mubetumi aboa wɔn bere biara mu na ɛte. Na me de, merenkyɛ wɔ mo nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/><char style="wj">Wayɛ nea obetumi. Wadi kan asra me nipadua ama da a wobesie me.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo se, baabiara a wɔbɛka asɛmpa no wɔ wiase no, wɔde nea ɔbea yi yɛe no bɛkae no akamfo no.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Pene So Sɛ Obeyi Yesu Ama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Afei Yuda Iskariot, asuafo dumien no mu baako, kɔɔ asɔfo mpanyin no nkyɛn ne wɔn kɔhyehyɛɛ sɛnea obeyi Yesu ama wɔn no ho. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Asɔfo mpanyin no tee asɛm no, ɛyɛɛ wɔn anigye ma wɔhyɛɛ no bɔ. Efi saa bere no, ɔhwehwɛɛ sɛnea obenya Yesu ho kwan, ayi no ama bere a ɛsɛ mu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ne Nʼasuafo Adidi A Etwa To</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Apiti Afahyɛ no da a edi kan a wokum Twam Afahyɛ guan no, nʼasuafo bisaa no faako a wɔbɛkɔ akodi Twam Afahyɛ no.<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Ɔsomaa nʼasuafo no mu baanu kɔɔ Yerusalem se wonkosiesie baabi mma no. Nea ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn ne sɛ, <char style="wj">“Morekɔ kurow no mu a, mubehyia onipa bi a ɔso ahina. Munni nʼakyi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/><char style="wj">Baabiara a obewura no, monka nkyerɛ ofiwura no se, ‘Yɛn wura asoma yɛn se, yɛmmɛhwɛ dan a wɔasiesie ama yɛn a yebedi Twam Afahyɛ no wɔ mu no.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/><char style="wj">Ɔbɛkyerɛ mo abansoro asa kɛse bi a wɔasiesie mu. Ɛhɔ na monyɛ ahoboa mma yɛn.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Asuafo baanu no sii mu kɔɔ kurow no mu, na wohuu biribiara sɛnea Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn no pɛpɛɛpɛ, na wosiesiee Twam no wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Eduu anwummere no, Yesu ne dumien no bae. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Na wɔte hɔ redidi no, Yesu kae se, <char style="wj">“Merema mo ate ase sɛ, mo a me ne mo reto nsa adidi yi mu baako beyi me ama.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Wɔn nyinaa werɛ howee, na wofii ase bisaa mmaako mmaako se, “Ɛyɛ me ana?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Obuaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ mo dumien a mo ne me reto nsa adidi yi mu baako.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no rekɔ sɛnea wɔakyerɛw afa ne ho de, nanso onipa a obeyi no ama no, nnue! Sɛ wɔanwo saa onipa no mpo a, anka eye!”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidi Kronkron Abɔse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Bere a wɔredidi no, Yesu faa brodo, na ohyiraa so bubui, na ɔde maa wɔn kae se, <char style="wj">“Munnye nni; eyi ne me nipadua.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Afei ɔfaa kuruwa a nsa wɔ mu, na ɔdaa ase no, ɔde maa wɔn, na wɔn nyinaa nom bi.<verse eid="MRK 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Eyi ne me mogya a ɛyɛ apam no mogya a ɛhyɛ Apam Foforo no mu den a bebree nti wɔrehwie agu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo se, merennom saa nsa yi bio da akosi da a me ne mo bɛnom bi bio wɔ Onyankopɔn Ahenni no mu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Wɔtoo dwom wiee no, wofii hɔ kɔɔ Ngo Bepɔw no so.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Pa A Petro Bɛpaw No No Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Woduu nea wɔrekɔ no, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo nyinaa beguan agya me.” Efisɛ Onyankopɔn nam adiyifo no so kae se,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Mɛbɔ oguanhwɛfo no,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="wj">na nguan no abɔ apete.’</char><verse eid="MRK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>
    <char style="wj">Na sɛ miwu sɔre a, medi mo anim akɔ Galilea akohyia mo wɔ hɔ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Sɛ nnipa nyinaa beguan agya wo a, me de, merenguan nnya wo da!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Petro, nokware, anadwo yi, ansa na akokɔ bɛbɔn mprenu no, na woapa me mprɛnsa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Petro de anibere kae se, “Merempa wo da! Sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ me ne wo wu mpo a, merempa wo da!” Saa ara na wɔn a aka no nyinaa nso kae.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Bɔ Mpae Wɔ Getsemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo no duu faako a wɔfrɛ hɔ Getsemane no, ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Montena ha, na merekɔbɔ mpae aba.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Ɔfaa Petro, Yakobo ne Yohane kaa ne ho, na ne ho fii ase yeraw no, na ɔyɛɛ basaa. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Awerɛhow ahyɛ me kra ma. Montena ha, na mo ne me nwɛn.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Ɔkɔɔ nʼanim kakra, kobutuw fam, bɔɔ mpae se, sɛ ebetumi a, saa ahoyeraw no ntwa ne ho nkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Ɔkae se, <char style="wj">“Abba, Agya! Wutumi yɛ biribiara. Ma kuruwa yi ntwa me ho nkɔ. Nanso nea wopɛ na ɛnyɛ hɔ, na ɛnyɛ nea mepɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Ɔsan bae no, obehuu asuafo baasa no sɛ wɔadeda. Obisaa Petro se, <char style="wj">“Simon, woada? Woantumi ne me anwɛn dɔnhwerew baako pɛ mpo?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/><char style="wj">Monwɛn na mommɔ mpae na ɔsɔhwɛfo no anni mo so. Honhom no pɛ de, nanso ɔhonam no yɛ mmerɛw.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Ɔsan kɔɔ bio kɔbɔɔ mpae koro no ara. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Ɔsan baa wɔn nkyɛn bio behuu sɛ wɔadeda, efisɛ na wɔabrɛbrɛ. Na wonhu nea wɔnka nkyerɛ no.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Ɔsan baa ne mprɛnsa so no, obisaa wɔn se. <char style="wj">“Moda so adeda a morehome? Bere a ɛsɛ sɛ mode da no atwa mu. Wɔrebeyi me ahyɛ nnebɔneyɛfo nsa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/><char style="wj">Monsɔre na yɛnkɔ! Monhwɛ, nea ɔreyi me ama no na ɔreba no!”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔkyere Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Ogu so rekasa no, Yuda a ɔyɛ nʼasuafo no mu baako ne dɔm a asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin asoma wɔn ka ne ho a, wokurakura mfoa ne nkontimmaa baa hɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Na Yuda aka akyerɛ wɔn dedaw se, “Nea mefew nʼafono no; ɔno ne nea morehwehwɛ no no. Monkyere no, na munso ne mu yiye mfa no nkɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Yuda kɔɔ Yesu nkyɛn kɔkae se, “Me Wura.” Afei ofew nʼafono, yɛɛ no atuu. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Ɛhɔ ara, na dɔm a wɔne Yuda nam no soo Yesu mu kyeree no. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Wɔn a wɔka Yesu ho no mu baako twee nʼafoa de twaa Ɔsɔfopanyin no akoa bi aso ma ɛtewee.<verse eid="MRK 14:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Meyɛ owudifo nti na mode afoa ne nkontimmaa aba me so rebɛkyere me ana?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/><char style="wj">Adɛn na bere a merekyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔredan mu hɔ no, moankyere me? Nanso eyinom nyinaa aba sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a nkɔm a wɔhyɛɛ wɔ me ho no bɛba mu.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Asuafo no nyinaa guan gyaa no.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Aberante bi a ɔde nwera akata nʼadagyaw so dii nʼakyi. <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>Dɔm a wɔbɛkyeree Yesu no pɛɛ sɛ wɔkyere no, nanso ogyaw ne ntama no maa wɔn, de ne ho saa ara guanee.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Gyina Ɔsɔfopanyin Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Wɔde Yesu kɔɔ Ɔsɔfopanyin no anim no, ankyɛ na asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin bi behyiaa hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Bere a wɔde Yesu rekɔ no, Petro tew ne ho dii wɔn akyi, na owiawiaa ne ho kɔhyɛɛ Ɔsɔfopanyin no fi hɔ de ne ho kɔfraa asomfo bi a na wɔreto gya no mu.<verse eid="MRK 14:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Asɔfo mpanyin ne baguafo no nyinaa hwehwɛɛ sɛ wobenya asɛm bi atia Yesu, na wɔagyina so abu no kumfɔ. Nanso wɔannya bi. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Nnipa pii bedii adansekurum tiaa Yesu, nanso wɔn nsɛm a wɔkaa no bɔɔ abira.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Afei nnipa no bi kekaa nsɛm a enni mu too ne so se, <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Yɛtee sɛ ɔkae se, ‘Mebubu asɔredan a wɔde nsa na esii no, na mede nnansa asi foforo a wɔamfa nsa ansi!’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Na eyi mpo, wɔn adanse no anhyia.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Ɔsɔfopanyin no sɔre gyinaa bagua no mfimfini bisaa Yesu se, “Eyi nso, wunni ho anoyi biara? Dɛn na wowɔ ka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Yesu ammua no. Afei, Ɔsɔfopanyin no bisaa no bio se, “Wone Agyenkwa no, Onyankopɔn Ba no ana?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yesu buaa no se, <char style="wj">“Mene no, na mubehu me sɛ mete Onyankopɔn nifa, na menam omununkum mu resan aba asase so.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Eyi maa Ɔsɔfopanyin no sunsuan nʼatade mu kae se, “Nnansefo bɛn na wɔn ho hia yɛn bio? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Mo nyinaa ate abususɛm a ɔkae no. Dɛn na mowɔ ka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Wɔn nyinaa gye too mu se, ɔsɛ owu. <verse eid="MRK 14:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Na ebinom tee ntasu guu no so, na wɔkyekyeree nʼani, na wɔbobɔɔ no akuturuku bisaa no se “Wuse woyɛ odiyifo, kyerɛ yɛn onipa ko a ɔbɔɔ wo!” Na asomfo a wɔde no rekɔ no bobɔɔ no asotɔre.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Pa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Bere a na Petro te adiwo hɔ no, Ɔsɔfopanyin no mmaawa no mu baako baa hɔ; <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>na ohuu Petro sɛ ɔreto gya no, ɔhwɛɛ no haa, ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Wo nso wo ne Nasareni Yesu no na ɛnam!”<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Petro sanee se, “Minnim nea woreka yi ho hwee!” Na ɛhɔ ara na ofii adi kɔtenaa ɔkwan no ano baabi. Saa bere no na akokɔ bɔn nea edi kan.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Abaawa no san huu no wɔ hɔ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn a ɔne wɔn nam no se, “Oyi nso ka wɔn ho. Ɔyɛ Yesu asuafo no mu baako!”<verse eid="MRK 14:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Petro san bio. Ɛkyɛe kakra no, nnipa a wogyina ogya no ho no fii ase ka kyerɛɛ Petro se, “Woka wɔn ho, efisɛ woyɛ Galileani!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.70 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petro kasa na ɛdaa no adi sɛ ɔyɛ Galileani na kɔ a ɔkɔtɔɔ Yudafo mu wɔ adiwo hɔ no na ɛma wohuu sɛ ɔyɛ Yesu akyidini.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Petro fii ase kekaa ntam, dii nsew se, “Minnim saa onipa a moreka ne ho asɛm yi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Mpofirim, na akokɔ bɔn nea ɛto so abien. Na Petro kaee Yesu asɛm a ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Akokɔ remmɔn mprenu na woapa me mprɛnsa”</char> no. Na ofii ase sui.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Gyina Pilato Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Ade kyee anɔpatutuutu no, asɔfo mpanyin, Yudafo mpanyin, Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo ne agyinatufo hyia dwenee ɔkwan a wɔde Yesu bɛfa so ho. Wɔkyekyeree no de no kɔhyɛɛ Pilato nsa.<verse eid="MRK 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Wɔde no duu hɔ no, Pilato bisaa no se, “Wone Yudafo hene no ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesu buae se, <char style="wj">“Mo na muse.”</char><verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Asɔfo mpanyin no kaa nsɛm akɛseakɛse guu no so, nanso wanka hwee. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Pilato bisaa no bio se, “Enti nsɛm akɛseakɛse a wɔreka gu wo so yi, wonka ho hwee?”<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Nanso Yesu anka hwee ma ɛyɛɛ Pilato nwonwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Na ɛyɛ Pilato amanne sɛ, afe biara ogyaa odeduani baako a ɔman no pɛ sɛ wogyaa no ma wɔn no wɔ Twam Afahyɛ mu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Saa afe no na onipa bi a wɔfrɛ no Baraba ka nnipa bi a wɔsɔre tiaa aban, nam so dii awu no ho wɔ afiase hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Dɔm no kɔɔ Pilato so kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, onyi odeduani baako mma wɔn sɛnea daa ɔyɛ no.<verse eid="MRK 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Pilato bisae se, “Minyi ‘Yudafo Hene’ no mma mo ana?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Efisɛ na wahu sɛ asɔfo mpanyin no de ɔtan na atwa asɛm ato Yesu so esiane din a na wagye no nti. <verse eid="MRK 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Nanso asɔfo mpanyin no tuu dɔm no aso se, sɛ wɔde beyi Yesu de, wɔmpere mma wonyi Baraba.<verse eid="MRK 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Enti Pilato bisaa wɔn se, “Na sɛ miyi Baraba ma mo a, dɛn na menyɛ saa ɔbarima yi a mofrɛ no mo hene no?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Wɔteɛteɛɛ mu se, “Bɔ no asennua mu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Pilato bisaa wɔn bio se, “Adɛn nti? Bɔne bɛn na wayɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Wɔn nyinaa bɔ gyee so se, “Bɔ no asennua mu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Afei Pilato huu sɛ ɔyɛ asɛm no ho hwee a, ɛrenyɛ ye. Bio, na osuro nso sɛ, sɛ anhwɛ a basabasayɛ bɛba nti, ogyaa Baraba maa wɔn. Ɔbɔɔ Yesu mmaa, na ɛno akyi no, ɔde no maa wɔn se wɔnkɔbɔ no asennua mu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ho Fɛwdi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Asraafo no de Yesu kɔɔ amrado aban mu hɔ, na wɔfrɛɛ asraafo no nyinaa baa hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Wɔhyɛɛ no batakari kɔkɔɔ bi, de nsɔe atenten bi nwenee kyɛw hyɛɛ no. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Wofii ase bɔ gyee so, dii ne ho fɛw se, “Yudafo hene, wo nkwa so!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Wɔde abaa paa nʼapampam, tetee ntasu guu no so, buu no nkotodwe, de dii ne ho fɛw. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Wodii ne ho fɛw wiee no, wɔworɔw batakari kɔkɔɔ no, na wɔde ɔno ara nʼatade hyɛɛ no, de no kɔɔ sɛ wɔrekɔbɔ no asennua mu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Yesu Asennua Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Wɔrekɔ no, wohyiaa ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Simon a ofi Kirene a ɔyɛ Aleksandro ne Rufo agya wɔ ɔkwan so. Wɔhyɛɛ no ma ɔsoaa Yesu asennua no. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Wɔde Yesu baa baabi a wɔfrɛ hɔ se Golgota, a ne nkyerɛase ne Nitiri so, hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Ɛhɔ na wɔmaa no nsa nwenweenwen bi sɛ ɔnnom, nanso wannom. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Afei wɔbɔɔ no asennua mu. Eyi akyi, wɔbɔɔ nʼatade no so ntonto.<verse eid="MRK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Ɛbɛyɛ anɔpa nnɔnkron na wɔbɔɔ no asennua mu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Asɛm bi a wɔka too no so na wɔkyerɛw taree nʼasennua no atifi ka se,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MRK 15:26">“YUDAFO HENE NO NI.”<verse eid="MRK 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Da no ara anɔpa, wɔbɔɔ awudifo baanu bi asennua mu kaa Yesu ho. Na ɔbaako sɛn ne nifa so, na ɔbaako nso sɛn ne benkum so. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Eyi maa nea Kyerɛwsɛm no kae se, “Wɔkan no fraa nnebɔneyɛfo mu” no baa mu. <verse eid="MRK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Nnipa a wɔsen faa hɔ no nyinaa wosowosow wɔn ti, dii ne ho fɛw se, “Ei, wo ni? Ɛnyɛ wo na wuse wubetumi abubu asɔredan na wode nnansa asi no? <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Sɛ wuse wo ho yɛ nwonwa a, ɛno de sian fi asennua no so si fam.” <verse eid="MRK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Saa bere no na asɔfo mpanyin ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo no nso atwa ahyia hɔ redi Yesu ho fɛw. Wɔkɔɔ so dii ne ho fɛw se, “Ogye afoforo nanso ontumi nnye ne ho!” <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Wɔkɔɔ so dii ne ho fɛw bio se, “Agyenkwa! Yudafo hene! Sian fi asennua no so si fam, na yennye wo nni!” Awudifo a wɔbɔɔ wɔne Yesu asennua mu no mpo dii ne ho fɛw bi.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Efi owigyinae kɔpem nnɔnabiɛsa no, sum duruu asase no so nyinaa. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Yesu de nne kɛse teɛɛ mu se, <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Eli, Eli, lama sabaktani?”</char></char> Ase ne sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me Nyankopɔn, Me Nyankopɔn, adɛn nti na woagyaw me?”</char><verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Wɔn a wogyina hɔ no bi a wɔtee nea ɔkae no kae se, “Muntie sɛ ɔrefrɛ Elia.”<verse eid="MRK 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Wɔn mu baako tuu mmirika, kɔfaa sapɔw bi de bɔɔ nsa nwenweenwen bi mu de tuaa dua bi ano, de brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔnnom. Ɔkae se, “Momma yɛnhwɛ sɛ Elia bɛba abeyi no asi fam ana!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Yesu de nne kɛse teɛɛ mu bio, na ogyaa ne honhom mu wui.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Ntama a etwa asɔredan no mu no mu suanee abien fi soro kosii fam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ntwamtam no twa Kronkronbea ne Kronkron Mu Kronkron no mu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-35">2 Mose 26.31-35</ref></char>). Ntwamtam no mu tew a ɛtewee no kyerɛ sɛ Kristo kɔ ɔsoro ma yɛn sɛnea ɛbɛma yɛn nso yɛapue wɔ Onyankopɔn anim.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Asraafo ha so panyin a na ogyina hɔ no huu ɔkwan a Yesu faa so wui no, ɔkae se, “Ampa ara, onipa yi yɛ Onyankopɔn Ba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Saa bere no na mmea bi gyinagyina akyiri baabi rehwɛ nea ɛrekɔ so. Mmea no bi ne Maria Magdalene, Maria (a ɔyɛ Yakobo Kumaa ne Yosef na), ne Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Bere a na Yesu wɔ Galilea no, saa mmea yi dii nʼakyi som no. Saa ara nso na na nnipa bi a wodii nʼakyi baa Yerusalem no bi nso wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Eduu anwummere no, esiane sɛ na ade kye a ɛyɛ Homeda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na ɛyɛ Fida a saa bere no na owigyinae atwa mu na ɛho hia yiye sɛ woyi Yesu amu no fi asennua no so ansa na onwini adwo na ama wɔafi Homeda no ase.</char></note> no nti, <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>baguani nuonyamfo bi a wɔfrɛ no Yosef, a ofi Arimatea a na ɔretwɛn Onyankopɔn ahenni no de akokoduru kɔɔ Pilato hɔ kɔsrɛɛ no se, ɔmfa Yesu amu no mma no. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Bere a Pilato tee sɛ Yesu awu no, wannye anni, enti ɔfrɛɛ Roma asraafo panyin a na ɔhwɛ hɔ no bisaa no. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Asraafo panyin no kae se wawu no, Pilato maa Yosef kwan se ɔnkɔfa amu no. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Yosef kɔtɔɔ nwera, yii Yesu amu no fii asennua no so, de nwera no kyekyeree no, ɔde no kɔtoo ɔboda bi a wɔatwa mu, pirew ɔbo kɛse bi hinii ano. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Na Maria Magdalene ne Yosef ne na Maria wɔ hɔ bi, na wohuu faako a wɔde Yesu amu no toe.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asɔre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Ade kyee a Homeda no twaa mu no, Maria Magdalene ne Salome ne Yakobo na Maria kɔtɔɔ nnuhuam se wɔde rekɔ akɔsra Yesu amu no. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Da a edi nnaawɔtwe no kan anɔpahema no, ansa na owia bepue no, wɔde nnuhuam no baa ɔda no so. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Wɔnam ɔkwan so rekɔ no, na wɔredwene nea ɛbɛyɛ a wobepirew ɔbo no afi ɔda no ano no ho.<verse eid="MRK 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Nanso wɔreyɛ adu hɔ no, wɔmaa wɔn ani so hui sɛ, obi apirew ɔbo kɛse no afi ɔda no ano. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Wɔkɔɔ ɔda no mu kohuu aberante bi sɛ ɔhyɛ atade fitaa te nifa so hɔ. Wohuu no no, wɔbɔɔ piriw.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Nanso aberante no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, “Munnsuro. Ɛnyɛ Nasareni Yesu a wɔbɔɔ no asennua mu no na morehwehwɛ no no? Onni ha! Wasɔre! Monhwɛ faako a wɔde no too hɔ! <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Afei monkɔ na monkɔka eyi nkyerɛ nʼasuafo no ne Petro se, ‘Yesu redi mo anim akɔ Galilea. Ɛhɔ na mubehu no, sɛnea ɔka kyerɛɛ mo ansa na ɔrewu no!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Mmea no de hu ne ahopopo guan fii hɔ a, na obiara ntumi ne ne yɔnko nkasa.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yi Ne Ho Adi Kyerɛ Maria Magdalene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Kwasida anɔpa na Yesu sɔre fii awufo mu. Onipa a oyii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ no kan ne Maria Magdalene, ɔbea a otuu ahonhommɔne ason fii ne mu no. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Maria Magdalene kɔɔ asuafo no nkyɛn kohuu wɔn sɛ wɔn werɛ ahow, na wɔresu. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, wahu Yesu na ɔte ase. Nanso wɔannye no anni.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yi Ne Ho Adi Kyerɛ Asuafo Baanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Akyiri no, Yesu yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ wɔn mu baanu a wɔnam fi Yerusalem rekɔ akuraa, nanso wohuu no no, mfiase no, wɔantumi anhu sɛ ɛyɛ ɔno, efisɛ na wasakra. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Akyiri no a wohuu onipa ko a ɔyɛ no, wotuu mmirika san baa Yerusalem, bɛka kyerɛɛ nkae no, nanso obiara annye wɔn anni.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Akyiri no a asuafo dubaako no te adidii no, oyii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ wɔn. Ɔkaa wɔn anim wɔ gyidi a wonni ne gye a wɔannye wɔn a wɔbɛkaa sɛ wasɔre no anni no ho.<verse eid="MRK 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asomafo No Asɛmpaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Afei ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monkɔ wiase nyinaa nkɔka asɛmpa no nkyerɛ nnipa nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ogye di na wɔbɔ no asu no, wobegye no nkwa. Na obiara a onnye nni no, wobebu no fɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/><char style="wj">Saa nsɛnkyerɛnne yi bedi wɔn a wogye me di no akyi. Wɔde me din betu ahonhommɔne, na wɔakasa kasa foforo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/><char style="wj">Wobeso awɔ mu, na sɛ wɔnom awuduru bi mpo a, ɛrenyɛ wɔn hwee; wɔde wɔn nsa begu ayarefo so, ama wɔn ho ayɛ wɔn den.”</char><verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sorokɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Awurade Yesu ne wɔn kasa wiee akyi no, wɔfaa no kɔɔ ɔsoro na ɔkɔtenaa Onyankopɔn nsa nifa so. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Eyi akyi no, asuafo no kɔkaa asɛm no wɔ baabiara, na Awurade kaa wɔn ho ma wɔyɛɛ nsɛnkyerɛnne ne anwonwade ahorow nso, de hyɛɛ wɔn nsɛm a wɔkae no mu den.<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
